<p data-start=3D"654" data-end=3D"718">dans d=E2=80=99autres paradigmes (fo=
nctionnel, proc=C3=A9dural, =C3=A9v=C3=A9nementiel)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"719" data-end=3D"791">
<p data-start=3D"721" data-end=3D"791">pour d'autres objectifs (mod=C3=A9li=
sation m=C3=A9tier, processus, architecture)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"792" data-end=3D"860">
<p data-start=3D"794" data-end=3D"860">dans d'autres domaines (ing=C3=A9nie=
rie syst=C3=A8me, base de donn=C3=A9es, etc.)</p>
</li>
</ul>
