<hr data-start=3D"3025" data-end=3D"3028">
<h3 data-start=3D"3030" data-end=3D"3077">=F0=9F=8E=AF 1.3 Quand UML est-il=
 le meilleur choix ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3079" data-end=3D"3456">
<li data-start=3D"3079" data-end=3D"3152">
<p data-start=3D"3081" data-end=3D"3152">Vous travaillez dans une =C3=A9qui=
pe de d=C3=A9veloppement logiciel orient=C3=A9 objet</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3153" data-end=3D"3225">
<p data-start=3D"3155" data-end=3D"3225">Vous avez besoin de <strong data-s=
tart=3D"3175" data-end=3D"3225">documenter =C3=A0 la fois le m=C3=A9tier et=
 la technique</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3226" data-end=3D"3314">
<p data-start=3D"3228" data-end=3D"3314">Vous utilisez des frameworks ou de=
s architectures complexes (MVC, microservices, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3315" data-end=3D"3381">
<p data-start=3D"3317" data-end=3D"3381">Vous devez mod=C3=A9liser <strong =
data-start=3D"3338" data-end=3D"3381">structure, comportement et interactio=
ns</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3382" data-end=3D"3456">
<p data-start=3D"3384" data-end=3D"3456">Vous voulez <strong data-start=3D"=
3396" data-end=3D"3419">un standard reconnu</strong> et <strong data-start=
=3D"3423" data-end=3D"3456">interop=C3=A9rable avec des outils</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3458" data-end=3D"3461">
<h3 data-start=3D"3463" data-end=3D"3517">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F 1.4 Quand UML =
n=E2=80=99est <strong data-start=3D"3490" data-end=3D"3497">pas</strong> le=
 meilleur choix ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3519" data-end=3D"3827">
<li data-start=3D"3519" data-end=3D"3586">
<p data-start=3D"3521" data-end=3D"3586">Pour des syst=C3=A8mes <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3539" data-end=3D"3561">non orient=C3=A9s objet</strong> (UML de=
vient artificiel)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3587" data-end=3D"3664">
<p data-start=3D"3589" data-end=3D"3664">Pour des <strong data-start=3D"359=
8" data-end=3D"3638">simulations de processus m=C3=A9tier purs</strong> (BP=
MN sera plus intuitif)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3665" data-end=3D"3748">
<p data-start=3D"3667" data-end=3D"3748">Pour des <strong data-start=3D"367=
6" data-end=3D"3728">mod=C3=A8les physiques/=C3=A9lectriques/ing=C3=A9nieri=
e syst=C3=A8me</strong> (SysML est pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9r=C3=A9)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3749" data-end=3D"3827">
<p data-start=3D"3751" data-end=3D"3827">Pour de simples diagrammes logique=
s de base de donn=C3=A9es (ERD est plus direct)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3829" data-end=3D"3832">
<h2 data-start=3D"3834" data-end=3D"3900">=F0=9F=9B=A0=EF=B8=8F Partie 2 : =
Les outils UML populaires (niveau professionnel)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"3902" data-end=3D"4047">UML peut =C3=AAtre <strong data-st=
art=3D"3916" data-end=3D"3937">dessin=C3=A9 =C3=A0 la main</strong> ou via =
des <strong data-start=3D"3949" data-end=3D"3971">outils sp=C3=A9cialis=C3=
=A9s</strong>, allant de simples =C3=A9diteurs =C3=A0 de puissantes suites =
d=E2=80=99ing=C3=A9nierie logicielle.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4049" data-end=3D"4134">Voici les outils les plus utilis=
=C3=A9s, avec leurs <strong data-start=3D"4096" data-end=3D"4133">forces, f=
aiblesses et cas d=E2=80=99usage</strong>.</p>
