 choix d=E2=80=99un outil UML</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4186" data-end=3D"4230">Avant de choisir un outil, il faut=
 =C3=A9valuer :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4232" data-end=3D"4559">
<li data-start=3D"4232" data-end=3D"4294">
<p data-start=3D"4234" data-end=3D"4294">Richesse de l=E2=80=99interface UM=
L (nombre de diagrammes support=C3=A9s)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4295" data-end=3D"4337">
<p data-start=3D"4297" data-end=3D"4337">G=C3=A9n=C3=A9ration / reverse eng=
ineering de code</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4338" data-end=3D"4372">
