/CD</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4373" data-end=3D"4422">
<p data-start=3D"4375" data-end=3D"4422">Support collaboratif (multi-utilis=
ateur, cloud)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4423" data-end=3D"4440">
<p data-start=3D"4425" data-end=3D"4440">Prix / licences</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4441" data-end=3D"4471">
<p data-start=3D"4443" data-end=3D"4471">Export (PDF, SVG, XMI, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4472" data-end=3D"4520">
<p data-start=3D"4474" data-end=3D"4520">Support des st=C3=A9r=C3=A9otypes,=
 profils personnalis=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4521" data-end=3D"4559">
<p data-start=3D"4523" data-end=3D"4559">Compatibilit=C3=A9 avec les standa=
rds OMG</p>
