<hr data-start=3D"472" data-end=3D"475">
<h2 data-start=3D"477" data-end=3D"498">=F0=9F=94=B9 1. Introduction</h2>
<p data-start=3D"500" data-end=3D"647">UML est avant tout un <strong data-s=
tart=3D"522" data-end=3D"563">langage de mod=C3=A9lisation orient=C3=A9 obj=
et</strong>, utilis=C3=A9 pour <strong data-start=3D"578" data-end=3D"646">=
concevoir, d=C3=A9crire, documenter et comprendre un syst=C3=A8me logiciel<=
/strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"649" data-end=3D"827">Avant de tracer le moindre diagramme=
, il faut comprendre trois <strong data-start=3D"712" data-end=3D"737">conc=
epts fondamentaux</strong> qui constituent la base de la structure UML :<br=
 data-start=3D"783" data-end=3D"786">
=F0=9F=91=89 <strong data-start=3D"789" data-end=3D"799">Mod=C3=A8le</stron=
g>, <strong data-start=3D"801" data-end=3D"808">Vue</strong>, et <strong da=
ta-start=3D"813" data-end=3D"826">Diagramme</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"829" data-end=3D"932">Ces trois =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments forment=
 la <strong data-start=3D"859" data-end=3D"872">charpente</strong> logique =
d=E2=80=99un projet UML, comme les fondations d=E2=80=99une maison.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"934" data-end=3D"937">
<h2 data-start=3D"939" data-end=3D"992">=F0=9F=93=8C 2. Le <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"951" data-end=3D"961">Mod=C3=A8le</strong> : la repr=C3=A9sentation d=
u syst=C3=A8me</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"994" data-end=3D"1011">=F0=9F=94=B7 D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1012" data-end=3D"1220">Un <strong data-start=3D"1015" dat=
a-end=3D"1025">mod=C3=A8le</strong> (model) est une <strong data-start=3D"1=
042" data-end=3D"1079">abstraction compl=C3=A8te et coh=C3=A9rente</strong>=
 d=E2=80=99un syst=C3=A8me r=C3=A9el ou conceptuel.<br data-start=3D"1112" =
data-end=3D"1115">
Il repr=C3=A9sente le <strong data-start=3D"1132" data-end=3D"1161">syst=C3=
=A8me dans son ensemble</strong>, mais sous une forme <strong data-start=3D=
"1183" data-end=3D"1197">simplifi=C3=A9e</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"=
1201" data-end=3D"1219">compr=C3=A9hensible</strong>.</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"1222" data-end=3D"1402">
<p data-start=3D"1224" data-end=3D"1402">=F0=9F=A7=A0 En UML, un mod=C3=A8l=
e est l=E2=80=99<strong data-start=3D"1251" data-end=3D"1272">entit=C3=A9 p=
rincipale</strong>, celle qui regroupe <strong data-start=3D"1293" data-end=
=3D"1320">toutes les informations</strong> concernant un syst=C3=A8me (stru=
cture, comportement, interactions, contraintes, etc.).</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"1404" data-end=3D"1407">
<h3 data-start=3D"1409" data-end=3D"1448">=F0=9F=94=B8 Caract=C3=A9ristique=
s d=E2=80=99un mod=C3=A8le UML</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1449" data-end=3D"1752">
<li data-start=3D"1449" data-end=3D"1531">
<p data-start=3D"1451" data-end=3D"1531">Il contient <strong data-start=3D"=
1463" data-end=3D"1481">plusieurs vues</strong>, chacune se concentrant sur=
 un aspect du syst=C3=A8me.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1532" data-end=3D"1586">
<p data-start=3D"1534" data-end=3D"1586">Il est <strong data-start=3D"1541"=
 data-end=3D"1554">structur=C3=A9</strong>, organis=C3=A9, et <strong data-=
start=3D"1569" data-end=3D"1585">hi=C3=A9rarchique</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1587" data-end=3D"1659">
<p data-start=3D"1589" data-end=3D"1659">Il est <strong data-start=3D"1596"=
 data-end=3D"1611">ind=C3=A9pendant</strong> du code source (m=C3=AAme s=E2=
=80=99il peut en =C3=AAtre g=C3=A9n=C3=A9r=C3=A9).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1660" data-end=3D"1752">
<p data-start=3D"1662" data-end=3D"1752">Il peut repr=C3=A9senter un syst=
=C3=A8me logiciel, un processus m=C3=A9tier, ou m=C3=AAme un syst=C3=A8me p=
hysique.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1754" data-end=3D"1757">
<h3 data-start=3D"1759" data-end=3D"1774">=F0=9F=93=8C Exemples</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1775" data-end=3D"1995">
<li data-start=3D"1775" data-end=3D"1884">
<p data-start=3D"1777" data-end=3D"1884">Un mod=C3=A8le de <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1790" data-end=3D"1828">syst=C3=A8me de gestion de biblioth=C3=A8que<=
/strong> : contient des classes comme Livre, Lecteur, Pr=C3=AAt, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1885" data-end=3D"1995">
<p data-start=3D"1887" data-end=3D"1995">Un mod=C3=A8le de <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1900" data-end=3D"1919">site e-commerce</strong> : inclut les utilisa=
teurs, produits, commandes, paiements, et interactions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1997" data-end=3D"2000">
<h2 data-start=3D"2002" data-end=3D"2064">=F0=9F=93=8C 3. La <strong data-s=
tart=3D"2014" data-end=3D"2021">Vue</strong> : une perspective sp=C3=A9cifi=
que sur le mod=C3=A8le</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2066" data-end=3D"2083">=F0=9F=94=B7 D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2084" data-end=3D"2196">Une <strong data-start=3D"2088" da=
ta-end=3D"2095">vue</strong> (view) est une <strong data-start=3D"2111" dat=
a-end=3D"2135">projection partielle</strong> du mod=C3=A8le, centr=C3=A9e s=
ur <strong data-start=3D"2159" data-end=3D"2184">un aspect particulier</str=
ong> du syst=C3=A8me.</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"2198" data-end=3D"2338">
<p data-start=3D"2200" data-end=3D"2338">Elle permet de <strong data-start=
=3D"2215" data-end=3D"2253">filtrer et organiser l=E2=80=99information</str=
ong> pour la rendre plus lisible selon le r=C3=B4le ou le besoin de la pers=
onne qui l=E2=80=99examine.</p>
</blockquote>
