<hr data-start=3D"3127" data-end=3D"3130">
<h3 data-start=3D"3132" data-end=3D"3164">=F0=9F=94=B8 Pourquoi plusieurs v=
ues ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3165" data-end=3D"3415">
<li data-start=3D"3165" data-end=3D"3197">
<p data-start=3D"3167" data-end=3D"3197">Pour <strong data-start=3D"3172" d=
ata-end=3D"3197">diviser la complexit=C3=A9</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3198" data-end=3D"3296">
<p data-start=3D"3200" data-end=3D"3296">Pour <strong data-start=3D"3205" d=
ata-end=3D"3233">adapter la communication</strong> au profil du lecteur (an=
alyste, d=C3=A9veloppeur, client, testeur=E2=80=A6)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3297" data-end=3D"3415">
<p data-start=3D"3299" data-end=3D"3415">Pour <strong data-start=3D"3304" d=
ata-end=3D"3335">faciliter la sp=C3=A9cialisation</strong> (ex. une =C3=A9q=
uipe se concentre sur le comportement, une autre sur l=E2=80=99architecture=
)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3417" data-end=3D"3420">
<h2 data-start=3D"3422" data-end=3D"3487">=F0=9F=93=8C 4. Le <strong data-s=
tart=3D"3434" data-end=3D"3447">Diagramme</strong> : la repr=C3=A9sentation=
 graphique d'une vue</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3489" data-end=3D"3506">=F0=9F=94=B7 D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3507" data-end=3D"3672">Un <strong data-start=3D"3510" dat=
a-end=3D"3527">diagramme UML</strong> est une <strong data-start=3D"3536" d=
ata-end=3D"3574">repr=C3=A9sentation graphique d'une vue</strong> particuli=
=C3=A8re du syst=C3=A8me.<br data-start=3D"3599" data-end=3D"3602">
Il permet de <strong data-start=3D"3615" data-end=3D"3629">visualiser</stro=
ng> les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments du mod=C3=A8le et leurs relations.</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"3674" data-end=3D"3802">
<p data-start=3D"3676" data-end=3D"3802">C=E2=80=99est l=E2=80=99<strong da=
ta-start=3D"3684" data-end=3D"3721">=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment le plus concret et vi=
suel</strong> en UML. Chaque diagramme fait partie d=E2=80=99une vue, et do=
nc indirectement du mod=C3=A8le.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"3804" data-end=3D"3807">
<h3 data-start=3D"3809" data-end=3D"3851">=F0=9F=94=B8 Types de diagrammes =
UML (officiels)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3853" data-end=3D"3934">UML 2.x d=C3=A9finit <strong data-=
start=3D"3869" data-end=3D"3895">14 types de diagrammes</strong>, r=C3=A9pa=
rtis en deux grandes cat=C3=A9gories :</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3936" data-end=3D"3969">=F0=9F=A7=B1 1. Diagrammes struct=
urels</h4>
<blockquote data-start=3D"3970" data-end=3D"4060">
