<hr data-start=3D"2365" data-end=3D"2368">
<h3 data-start=3D"2370" data-end=3D"2386">=F0=9F=A7=A0 =C3=80 retenir</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2387" data-end=3D"2578">Le pilier structure est <strong da=
ta-start=3D"2411" data-end=3D"2458">essentiel pour la conception orient=C3=
=A9e objet</strong>.<br data-start=3D"2459" data-end=3D"2462">
C=E2=80=99est souvent <strong data-start=3D"2476" data-end=3D"2497">la prem=
i=C3=A8re =C3=A9tape</strong> de la mod=C3=A9lisation, car elle d=C3=A9fini=
t les <strong data-start=3D"2539" data-end=3D"2566">"blocs de construction"=
</strong> du syst=C3=A8me.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2580" data-end=3D"2583">
<h2 data-start=3D"2585" data-end=3D"2634">=F0=9F=94=81 2. Comportement : le=
s dynamiques du syst=C3=A8me</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2636" data-end=3D"2653">=F0=9F=8E=AC D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2655" data-end=3D"2759">Le <strong data-start=3D"2658" dat=
a-end=3D"2683">pilier comportemental</strong> d=C3=A9crit <strong data-star=
t=3D"2691" data-end=3D"2706">les actions</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"27=
08" data-end=3D"2721">r=C3=A9actions</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"2725=
" data-end=3D"2747">processus internes</strong> du syst=C3=A8me.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2761" data-end=3D"2897">Il s=E2=80=99agit ici de r=C3=A9po=
ndre =C3=A0 la question : <strong data-start=3D"2803" data-end=3D"2830">"Qu=
e fait le syst=C3=A8me ?"</strong>, en termes de <strong data-start=3D"2845=
" data-end=3D"2865">flux d=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cution</strong>, <strong data-st=
art=3D"2867" data-end=3D"2880">de r=C3=A8gles</strong>, ou <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"2885" data-end=3D"2896">d=E2=80=99=C3=A9tats</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2899" data-end=3D"2902">
<h3 data-start=3D"2904" data-end=3D"2920">=F0=9F=93=8C Objectifs</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2922" data-end=3D"3102">
<li data-start=3D"2922" data-end=3D"3002">
<p data-start=3D"2924" data-end=3D"3002">Repr=C3=A9senter les <strong data-=
start=3D"2940" data-end=3D"2959">flux de travail</strong>, <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"2961" data-end=3D"2976">traitements</strong>, ou <strong data-start=
=3D"2981" data-end=3D"3001">sc=C3=A9narios m=C3=A9tier</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3003" data-end=3D"3047">
<p data-start=3D"3005" data-end=3D"3047">D=C3=A9crire les <strong data-star=
t=3D"3017" data-end=3D"3026">=C3=A9tats</strong> internes d=E2=80=99un obje=
t.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3048" data-end=3D"3102">
<p data-start=3D"3050" data-end=3D"3102">Montrer l=E2=80=99encha=C3=AEnemen=
t des <strong data-start=3D"3077" data-end=3D"3090">activit=C3=A9s</strong>=
 du syst=C3=A8me.</p>
</li>
</ul>
