<p data-start=3D"3570" data-end=3D"3671">Utile pour la <strong data-start=
=3D"3584" data-end=3D"3607">mod=C3=A9lisation m=C3=A9tier</strong>, les <st=
rong data-start=3D"3613" data-end=3D"3634">r=C3=A8gles de gestion</strong>,=
 et la <strong data-start=3D"3642" data-end=3D"3670">validation des exigenc=
es</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3672" data-end=3D"3726">
<p data-start=3D"3674" data-end=3D"3726">Permet aussi d=E2=80=99anticiper l=
es <strong data-start=3D"3703" data-end=3D"3725">tests fonctionnels</strong=
>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3728" data-end=3D"3731">
<h2 data-start=3D"3733" data-end=3D"3795">=F0=9F=94=84 3. Interaction : les=
 relations dynamiques entre =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3797" data-end=3D"3814">=F0=9F=94=97 D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3816" data-end=3D"3976">Le <strong data-start=3D"3819" dat=
a-end=3D"3846">pilier des interactions</strong> se concentre sur les <stron=
g data-start=3D"3868" data-end=3D"3897">=C3=A9changes entre les objets</str=
ong>, <strong data-start=3D"3899" data-end=3D"3913">composants</strong>, ou=
 <strong data-start=3D"3918" data-end=3D"3929">acteurs</strong> dans le cad=
re d=E2=80=99un sc=C3=A9nario ou d=E2=80=99un processus.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3978" data-end=3D"4096">C=E2=80=99est un <strong data-star=
t=3D"3987" data-end=3D"4020">sous-ensemble du comportement</strong>, focali=
s=C3=A9 <strong data-start=3D"4031" data-end=3D"4063">sur les =C3=A9changes=
 de messages</strong> plut=C3=B4t que les actions internes.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4098" data-end=3D"4101">
<h3 data-start=3D"4103" data-end=3D"4119">=F0=9F=93=8C Objectifs</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4121" data-end=3D"4295">
<li data-start=3D"4121" data-end=3D"4187">
<p data-start=3D"4123" data-end=3D"4187">Montrer comment les objets collabo=
rent pour accomplir une t=C3=A2che.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4188" data-end=3D"4232">
<p data-start=3D"4190" data-end=3D"4232">D=C3=A9crire <strong data-start=3D=
"4198" data-end=3D"4218">l=E2=80=99ordre temporel</strong> des messages.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4233" data-end=3D"4295">
<p data-start=3D"4235" data-end=3D"4295">Simuler des sc=C3=A9narios pr=C3=
=A9cis d=E2=80=99utilisation ou de traitement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
