 <strong data-start=3D"4952" data-end=3D"4979">sp=C3=A9cification technique=
</strong>, ou pour la <strong data-start=3D"4992" data-end=3D"5032">validat=
ion des cas d=E2=80=99usage d=C3=A9taill=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
