tion</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5130" data-end=3D"5269">Le <strong data-start=3D"5133" dat=
a-end=3D"5157">pilier architectural</strong> aborde la <strong data-start=
=3D"5168" data-end=3D"5200">structure globale du syst=C3=A8me</strong>, ses=
 <strong data-start=3D"5206" data-end=3D"5217">modules</strong>, <strong da=
ta-start=3D"5219" data-end=3D"5238">infrastructures</strong>, et <strong da=
ta-start=3D"5243" data-end=3D"5268">moyens de d=C3=A9ploiement</strong>.</p=
>
<p data-start=3D"5271" data-end=3D"5376">Il traite de <strong data-start=3D=
"5284" data-end=3D"5337">comment les composants sont organis=C3=A9s et ex=
=C3=A9cut=C3=A9s</strong> dans un environnement r=C3=A9el ou logique.</p>
