</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5127" data-end=3D"5144">=F0=9F=A7=A0 Avantages</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5146" data-end=3D"5305">
<li data-start=3D"5146" data-end=3D"5202">
<p data-start=3D"5148" data-end=3D"5202">UML est <strong data-start=3D"5156=
" data-end=3D"5175">int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9 au c=C5=93ur</strong> du cycle de d=
=C3=A9veloppement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5203" data-end=3D"5305">
<p data-start=3D"5205" data-end=3D"5305">Les outils IBM Rational (Rational =
Rose, Rational Software Architect) ont =C3=A9t=C3=A9 con=C3=A7us pour UML e=
t RUP.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5307" data-end=3D"5310">
<h3 data-start=3D"5312" data-end=3D"5360">=F0=9F=94=84 3. UML et les m=C3=
=A9thodes Agiles (Scrum, XP)</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"5362" data-end=3D"5387">=F0=9F=A7=AD Philosophie Agile</h=
4>
<p data-start=3D"5389" data-end=3D"5431">Les m=C3=A9thodes Agiles mettent l=
=E2=80=99accent sur :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5432" data-end=3D"5569">
<li data-start=3D"5432" data-end=3D"5461">
<p data-start=3D"5434" data-end=3D"5461">L=E2=80=99adaptation au changement=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5462" data-end=3D"5520">
<p data-start=3D"5464" data-end=3D"5520">Le fonctionnement du logiciel plus=
 que la documentation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5521" data-end=3D"5569">
<p data-start=3D"5523" data-end=3D"5569">Les interactions humaines plus que=
 les outils.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5571" data-end=3D"5611">=E2=9A=96=EF=B8=8F UML dans Agile=
 : avec parcimonie</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5613" data-end=3D"5968">
<li data-start=3D"5613" data-end=3D"5714">
<p data-start=3D"5615" data-end=3D"5714">UML est utilis=C3=A9 de mani=C3=A8=
re <strong data-start=3D"5642" data-end=3D"5652">l=C3=A9g=C3=A8re</strong>,=
 <strong data-start=3D"5654" data-end=3D"5669">juste assez</strong>, souven=
t sous forme de <strong data-start=3D"5693" data-end=3D"5713">mod=C3=A8les =
jetables</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5715" data-end=3D"5968">
<p data-start=3D"5717" data-end=3D"5751">On l=E2=80=99emploie principalemen=
t pour :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5754" data-end=3D"5968">
<li data-start=3D"5754" data-end=3D"5826">
<p data-start=3D"5756" data-end=3D"5826">Clarifier un besoin m=C3=A9tier av=
ec un diagramme de <strong data-start=3D"5804" data-end=3D"5825">cas d=E2=
=80=99utilisation</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5829" data-end=3D"5910">
<p data-start=3D"5831" data-end=3D"5910">Concevoir une solution complexe vi=
a un <strong data-start=3D"5870" data-end=3D"5895">diagramme de s=C3=A9quen=
ce</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"5899" data-end=3D"5909">classe</strong=
>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5913" data-end=3D"5968">
<p data-start=3D"5915" data-end=3D"5968">Documenter une API ou une architec=
ture si n=C3=A9cessaire.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5970" data-end=3D"5987">=F0=9F=A7=A0 Avantages</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5989" data-end=3D"6235">
<li data-start=3D"5989" data-end=3D"6107">
<p data-start=3D"5991" data-end=3D"6107">UML peut =C3=AAtre un excellent <s=
trong data-start=3D"6018" data-end=3D"6053">outil de communication visuelle=
</strong> dans les daily stand-ups ou lors du backlog grooming.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6108" data-end=3D"6235">
<p data-start=3D"6110" data-end=3D"6235">On pr=C3=A9f=C3=A8re les <strong d=
ata-start=3D"6125" data-end=3D"6144">mod=C3=A8les simples</strong>, =C3=A9v=
olutifs, mis =C3=A0 jour sur un <strong data-start=3D"6175" data-end=3D"618=
9">whiteboard</strong> ou une <strong data-start=3D"6197" data-end=3D"6209"=
>tablette</strong>, pas dans un outil lourd.</p>
</li>
</ul>
