<h2 data-start=3D"5917" data-end=3D"5971">=F0=9F=A7=A0 7. Pratiques avanc=
=C3=A9es et astuces de mod=C3=A9lisation</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5973" data-end=3D"5995">=E2=9C=85 Bonnes pratiques</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5997" data-end=3D"6364">
<li data-start=3D"5997" data-end=3D"6111">
<p data-start=3D"5999" data-end=3D"6111">N=E2=80=99utilisez <strong data-st=
art=3D"6010" data-end=3D"6036">agr=C3=A9gation/composition</strong> que si =
la <strong data-start=3D"6047" data-end=3D"6086">relation de d=C3=A9pendanc=
e forte/faible</strong> est r=C3=A9ellement pr=C3=A9sente.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6112" data-end=3D"6199">
<p data-start=3D"6114" data-end=3D"6199">Privil=C3=A9giez <strong data-star=
t=3D"6126" data-end=3D"6141">l=E2=80=99interface</strong> pour <strong data=
-start=3D"6147" data-end=3D"6166">d=C3=A9finir un r=C3=B4le</strong> ou <st=
rong data-start=3D"6170" data-end=3D"6198">garantir un comportement</strong=
>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6200" data-end=3D"6283">
<p data-start=3D"6202" data-end=3D"6283">Une <strong data-start=3D"6206" da=
ta-end=3D"6227">composition forte</strong> (=E2=97=86) doit avoir une <stro=
ng data-start=3D"6247" data-end=3D"6282">relation de cycle de vie strict</s=
trong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6284" data-end=3D"6364">
<p data-start=3D"6286" data-end=3D"6364">Limitez les <strong data-start=3D"=
6298" data-end=3D"6320">h=C3=A9ritages profonds</strong> (&gt; 3 niveaux) p=
our pr=C3=A9server la lisibilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6366" data-end=3D"6381">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F =C3=80 =C3=A9v=
iter</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6383" data-end=3D"6570">
<li data-start=3D"6383" data-end=3D"6436">
<p data-start=3D"6385" data-end=3D"6436">Ajouter des associations circulair=
es sans n=C3=A9cessit=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6437" data-end=3D"6521">
<p data-start=3D"6439" data-end=3D"6521">Mod=C3=A9liser des attributs comme=
 des classes =C3=A0 part enti=C3=A8re sans justification m=C3=A9tier</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6522" data-end=3D"6570">
<p data-start=3D"6524" data-end=3D"6570">Trop de classes abstraites sans co=
ncr=C3=A9tisation</p>
</li>
</ul>
