<p data-start=3D"4124" data-end=3D"4138"><strong data-start=3D"4124" data-e=
nd=3D"4136">Contexte</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4139" data-end=3D"4376">
<li data-start=3D"4139" data-end=3D"4213">
<p data-start=3D"4141" data-end=3D"4213">Une <strong data-start=3D"4145" da=
ta-end=3D"4157">Personne</strong> r=C3=A9serve une <strong data-start=3D"41=
70" data-end=3D"4179">Salle</strong> pour une <strong data-start=3D"4189" d=
ata-end=3D"4205">PlageHoraire</strong> donn=C3=A9e.</p>
