<p data-start=3D"5601" data-end=3D"5670">Cela repr=C3=A9sente <strong data-=
start=3D"5617" data-end=3D"5633">une instance</strong> de <code data-start=
=3D"5637" data-end=3D"5645">Logger</code> <strong data-start=3D"5646" data-=
end=3D"5669">sans nom sp=C3=A9cifique</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5672" data-end=3D"5675">
<h2 data-start=3D"5677" data-end=3D"5702">=F0=9F=92=A1 7. Bonnes pratiques<=
/h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5704" data-end=3D"5717">=E2=9C=85 =C3=80 faire</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5719" data-end=3D"5984">
<li data-start=3D"5719" data-end=3D"5781">
<p data-start=3D"5721" data-end=3D"5781">Donner des <strong data-start=3D"5=
732" data-end=3D"5751">noms explicites</strong> aux objets pour la lisibili=
t=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5782" data-end=3D"5856">
<p data-start=3D"5784" data-end=3D"5856">Limiter la <strong data-start=3D"5=
795" data-end=3D"5816">quantit=C3=A9 d'objets</strong> dans un diagramme po=
ur garder sa clart=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5857" data-end=3D"5936">
<p data-start=3D"5859" data-end=3D"5936">Utiliser des diagrammes d=E2=80=99=
objets pour <strong data-start=3D"5897" data-end=3D"5925">illustrer un cas =
d=E2=80=99usage</strong> sp=C3=A9cifique</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5937" data-end=3D"5984">
<p data-start=3D"5939" data-end=3D"5984">S=E2=80=99en servir pour <strong d=
ata-start=3D"5956" data-end=3D"5984">valider une mod=C3=A9lisation</strong>=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5986" data-end=3D"6000">=E2=9D=8C =C3=80 =C3=A9viter</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6002" data-end=3D"6232">
<li data-start=3D"6002" data-end=3D"6087">
<p data-start=3D"6004" data-end=3D"6087">Repr=C3=A9senter <strong data-star=
t=3D"6016" data-end=3D"6049">toutes les classes du syst=C3=A8me</strong> so=
us forme d=E2=80=99objets : c=E2=80=99est illisible</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6088" data-end=3D"6160">
<p data-start=3D"6090" data-end=3D"6160">M=C3=A9langer des <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"6103" data-end=3D"6140">diagrammes de classes et d=E2=80=99objets</st=
rong> dans le m=C3=AAme graphe</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6161" data-end=3D"6232">
<p data-start=3D"6163" data-end=3D"6232">Omettre les <strong data-start=3D"=
6175" data-end=3D"6198">valeurs d'attributs</strong>, qui sont le c=C5=93ur=
 de ce diagramme</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6234" data-end=3D"6237">
<h2 data-start=3D"6239" data-end=3D"6269">=F0=9F=A7=A0 8. Utilisations avan=
c=C3=A9es</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6271" data-end=3D"6558">
<li data-start=3D"6271" data-end=3D"6392">
<p data-start=3D"6273" data-end=3D"6392"><strong data-start=3D"6273" data-e=
nd=3D"6332">Tester des contraintes OCL (Object Constraint Language)</strong=
> : valider les r=C3=A8gles de votre mod=C3=A8le =C3=A0 partir des instance=
s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6393" data-end=3D"6496">
<p data-start=3D"6395" data-end=3D"6496"><strong data-start=3D"6395" data-e=
nd=3D"6464">Ex=C3=A9cuter des sc=C3=A9narios dans des outils comme Enterpri=
se Architect</strong> pour observer les flux d=E2=80=99objets</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6497" data-end=3D"6558">
<p data-start=3D"6499" data-end=3D"6558"><strong data-start=3D"6499" data-e=
nd=3D"6537">Documenter l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat initial ou final</strong> d=E2=
=80=99un sc=C3=A9nario m=C3=A9tier</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6560" data-end=3D"6563">
<h2 data-start=3D"6565" data-end=3D"6581">=F0=9F=8F=81 Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6583" data-end=3D"6624">Le <strong data-start=3D"6586" dat=
a-end=3D"6612">diagramme d=E2=80=99objets UML</strong> permet de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6626" data-end=3D"6799">
<li data-start=3D"6626" data-end=3D"6672">
<p data-start=3D"6628" data-end=3D"6672"><strong data-start=3D"6628" data-e=
nd=3D"6660">Illustrer l=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cution r=C3=A9elle</strong> d=E2=80=
=99un mod=C3=A8le</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6673" data-end=3D"6717">
<p data-start=3D"6675" data-end=3D"6717"><strong data-start=3D"6675" data-e=
nd=3D"6717">Tester et valider des sc=C3=A9narios m=C3=A9tier</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6718" data-end=3D"6799">
<p data-start=3D"6720" data-end=3D"6799"><strong data-start=3D"6720" data-e=
nd=3D"6751">Expliquer un fonctionnement</strong> de mani=C3=A8re concr=C3=
=A8te =C3=A0 diff=C3=A9rents interlocuteurs</p>
</li>
</ul>
