 UML =E2=80=93 Diagramme d=E2=80=99Objets</h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"496" data-end=3D"563">=F0=9F=A7=AD Sujet : Valeurs des at=
tributs, Utilisation dans les sc=C3=A9narios</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"565" data-end=3D"568">
<h2 data-start=3D"570" data-end=3D"615">=F0=9F=94=B0 1. Rappel sur le diagr=
amme d=E2=80=99objets UML</h2>
<p data-start=3D"617" data-end=3D"791">Le <strong data-start=3D"620" data-e=
nd=3D"642">diagramme d=E2=80=99objets</strong> repr=C3=A9sente un <strong d=
ata-start=3D"657" data-end=3D"683">=C3=A9tat fig=C3=A9 d=E2=80=99un syst=C3=
=A8me</strong> =C3=A0 un moment donn=C3=A9, avec des <strong data-start=3D"=
712" data-end=3D"733">objets instanci=C3=A9s</strong>, leurs <strong data-s=
tart=3D"741" data-end=3D"764">valeurs d=E2=80=99attributs</strong>, et leur=
s <strong data-start=3D"775" data-end=3D"790">liens r=C3=A9els</strong>.</p=
>
<p data-start=3D"793" data-end=3D"831">Il est particuli=C3=A8rement utilis=
=C3=A9 pour :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"832" data-end=3D"991">
<li data-start=3D"832" data-end=3D"870">
<p data-start=3D"834" data-end=3D"870"><strong data-start=3D"834" data-end=
=3D"847">Illustrer</strong> un exemple d'ex=C3=A9cution</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"871" data-end=3D"899">
<p data-start=3D"873" data-end=3D"899"><strong data-start=3D"873" data-end=
=3D"885">Analyser</strong> un cas m=C3=A9tier</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"900" data-end=3D"936">
<p data-start=3D"902" data-end=3D"936"><strong data-start=3D"902" data-end=
=3D"912">Tester</strong> la validit=C3=A9 d=E2=80=99un mod=C3=A8le</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"937" data-end=3D"991">
<p data-start=3D"939" data-end=3D"991"><strong data-start=3D"939" data-end=
=3D"952">Expliquer</strong> un fonctionnement =C3=A0 un non-d=C3=A9veloppeu=
r</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"993" data-end=3D"996">
<h2 data-start=3D"998" data-end=3D"1028">=F0=9F=94=B6 2. Valeurs des attrib=
uts</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"1030" data-end=3D"1033">
<h3 data-start=3D"1035" data-end=3D"1091">=F0=9F=94=8D 2.1 Qu=E2=80=99est-c=
e qu=E2=80=99une valeur d=E2=80=99attribut dans UML ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1093" data-end=3D"1190">Dans un <strong data-start=3D"1101=
" data-end=3D"1125">diagramme de classes</strong>, on d=C3=A9finit les <str=
ong data-start=3D"1142" data-end=3D"1155">attributs</strong> des classes, m=
ais <strong data-start=3D"1174" data-end=3D"1189">sans valeur</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1192" data-end=3D"1271">Dans un <strong data-start=3D"1200=
" data-end=3D"1222">diagramme d=E2=80=99objets</strong>, chaque objet peut =
(et doit souvent) pr=C3=A9senter :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1272" data-end=3D"1366">
<li data-start=3D"1272" data-end=3D"1320">
<p data-start=3D"1274" data-end=3D"1320">Des <strong data-start=3D"1278" da=
ta-end=3D"1299">valeurs concr=C3=A8tes</strong> pour chaque attribut</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1321" data-end=3D"1366">
<p data-start=3D"1323" data-end=3D"1366">Une <strong data-start=3D"1327" da=
ta-end=3D"1366">instanciation partielle ou compl=C3=A8te</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
