<p data-start=3D"3521" data-end=3D"3628">Un <strong data-start=3D"3524" dat=
a-end=3D"3532">port</strong> est un <strong data-start=3D"3540" data-end=3D=
"3563">point d'interaction</strong> d=E2=80=99un composant, qui expose une =
<strong data-start=3D"3595" data-end=3D"3608">interface</strong> fournie ou=
