</li>
<li data-start=3D"3711" data-end=3D"3792">
<p data-start=3D"3713" data-end=3D"3792">Il <strong data-start=3D"3716" dat=
a-end=3D"3729">simplifie</strong> l=E2=80=99architecture en rendant explici=
tes les points d=E2=80=99int=C3=A9gration.</p>
</li>
</ul>
