<hr data-start=3D"4609" data-end=3D"4612">
<h2 data-start=3D"4614" data-end=3D"4663">=F0=9F=A7=A0 4. Mod=C3=A9lisation=
 avanc=C3=A9e et bonnes pratiques</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"4665" data-end=3D"4668">
<h3 data-start=3D"4670" data-end=3D"4705">=E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F 4.1 Hi=C3=A9ra=
rchie de composants</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4707" data-end=3D"4750">Les composants peuvent =C3=AAtre <=
strong data-start=3D"4735" data-end=3D"4748">imbriqu=C3=A9s</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4752" data-end=3D"4968">
<li data-start=3D"4752" data-end=3D"4858">
<p data-start=3D"4754" data-end=3D"4858">Un composant <strong data-start=3D=
"4767" data-end=3D"4779">frontend</strong> peut contenir des sous-composant=
s <code data-start=3D"4814" data-end=3D"4832">Authentification</code>, <cod=
e data-start=3D"4834" data-end=3D"4852">RechercheProduit</code>, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4859" data-end=3D"4968">
<p data-start=3D"4861" data-end=3D"4968">Un <strong data-start=3D"4864" dat=
a-end=3D"4887">composant composite</strong> peut =C3=AAtre vu comme un <str=
ong data-start=3D"4910" data-end=3D"4932">package d=C3=A9ployable</strong> =
qui regroupe plusieurs sous-unit=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4970" data-end=3D"4973">
<h3 data-start=3D"4975" data-end=3D"5008">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F 4.2 D=C3=A9pen=
dances explicites</h3>
<blockquote data-start=3D"5010" data-end=3D"5134">
<p data-start=3D"5012" data-end=3D"5134">Plus vos interfaces et ports sont =
<strong data-start=3D"5046" data-end=3D"5073">mod=C3=A9lis=C3=A9s explicite=
ment</strong>, plus votre architecture est <strong data-start=3D"5103" data=
-end=3D"5133">compr=C3=A9hensible et testable</strong>.</p>
</blockquote>
<ul data-start=3D"5136" data-end=3D"5237">
<li data-start=3D"5136" data-end=3D"5171">
<p data-start=3D"5138" data-end=3D"5171">=C3=89vitez les connexions implici=
tes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5172" data-end=3D"5237">
<p data-start=3D"5174" data-end=3D"5237">Utilisez des <strong data-start=3D=
"5187" data-end=3D"5209">interfaces nomm=C3=A9es</strong>, <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"5211" data-end=3D"5236">ports bien identifi=C3=A9s</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
