<hr data-start=3D"3302" data-end=3D"3305">
<h2 data-start=3D"3307" data-end=3D"3377">=F0=9F=94=B9 3. Utilisation des d=
=C3=A9pendances dans les architectures modulaires</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"3379" data-end=3D"3382">
<h3 data-start=3D"3384" data-end=3D"3436">=F0=9F=93=A6 3.1 Qu=E2=80=99est-c=
e qu=E2=80=99une architecture modulaire ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3438" data-end=3D"3604">Une architecture modulaire est une=
 organisation du syst=C3=A8me en <strong data-start=3D"3500" data-end=3D"35=
22">blocs ind=C3=A9pendants</strong> (modules ou composants) reli=C3=A9s pa=
r des <strong data-start=3D"3562" data-end=3D"3590">interfaces bien d=C3=A9=
finies</strong>, permettant :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3606" data-end=3D"3696">
<li data-start=3D"3606" data-end=3D"3623">
<p data-start=3D"3608" data-end=3D"3623">R=C3=A9utilisabilit=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3624" data-end=3D"3637">
<p data-start=3D"3626" data-end=3D"3637">Testabilit=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3638" data-end=3D"3662">
<p data-start=3D"3640" data-end=3D"3662">Maintenance simplifi=C3=A9e</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3663" data-end=3D"3696">
<p data-start=3D"3665" data-end=3D"3696">D=C3=A9ploiement isol=C3=A9 ou pro=
gressif</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3698" data-end=3D"3701">
<h3 data-start=3D"3703" data-end=3D"3751">=F0=9F=A7=B1 3.2 R=C3=B4le des d=
=C3=A9pendances dans les modules</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"3753" data-end=3D"3791">Dans une architecture modulaire :=
</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3792" data-end=3D"3975">
<li data-start=3D"3792" data-end=3D"3833">
<p data-start=3D"3794" data-end=3D"3833">Chaque module <strong data-start=
=3D"3808" data-end=3D"3833">expose des interfaces</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3834" data-end=3D"3897">
<p data-start=3D"3836" data-end=3D"3897">Les d=C3=A9pendances entre modules=
 sont <strong data-start=3D"3871" data-end=3D"3897">contr=C3=B4l=C3=A9es et=
 limit=C3=A9es</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3898" data-end=3D"3975">
<p data-start=3D"3900" data-end=3D"3975">Les modules <strong data-start=3D"=
3912" data-end=3D"3949">ne connaissent que les interfaces</strong>, <strong=
 data-start=3D"3951" data-end=3D"3975">pas l=E2=80=99impl=C3=A9mentation</s=
trong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3977" data-end=3D"4053">Cela se traduit par des <strong da=
ta-start=3D"4001" data-end=3D"4025">d=C3=A9pendances dirig=C3=A9es</strong>=
 et <strong data-start=3D"4029" data-end=3D"4052">faiblement coupl=C3=A9es<=
/strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4055" data-end=3D"4058">
