=A9s :</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"393" data-end=3D"464">
<li data-start=3D"393" data-end=3D"412">
<p data-start=3D"395" data-end=3D"412">Connexions r=C3=A9seau</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"413" data-end=3D"464">
<p data-start=3D"415" data-end=3D"464">D=C3=A9ploiement multi-niveaux (clie=
nt/serveur, cloud)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"466" data-end=3D"469">
<h2 data-start=3D"471" data-end=3D"489">=F0=9F=A7=AD Introduction</h2>
<p data-start=3D"491" data-end=3D"696">Le <strong data-start=3D"494" data-e=
nd=3D"526">diagramme de d=C3=A9ploiement UML</strong> d=C3=A9crit <strong d=
ata-start=3D"534" data-end=3D"561">la disposition physique</strong> des =C3=
=A9l=C3=A9ments logiciels (artefacts) sur les ressources d=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9=
cution (n=C5=93uds) ainsi que les <strong data-start=3D"650" data-end=3D"69=
5">liens de communication entre ces =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"698" data-end=3D"728">Ce tutoriel se concentre sur :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"729" data-end=3D"1006">
<li data-start=3D"729" data-end=3D"853">
<p data-start=3D"731" data-end=3D"853">Comment <strong data-start=3D"739" d=
ata-end=3D"768">mod=C3=A9liser les flux r=C3=A9seau</strong>, les <strong d=
ata-start=3D"774" data-end=3D"788">protocoles</strong>, les <strong data-st=
art=3D"794" data-end=3D"819">connexions s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9es</strong>, les =
<strong data-start=3D"825" data-end=3D"853">interactions inter-n=C5=93uds</=
strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"854" data-end=3D"1006">
<p data-start=3D"856" data-end=3D"1006">Comment repr=C3=A9senter des <stron=
g data-start=3D"880" data-end=3D"909">architectures distribu=C3=A9es</stron=
g>, =C3=A0 <strong data-start=3D"913" data-end=3D"934">plusieurs niveaux</s=
trong> : client/serveur, n-tiers, Cloud, SaaS/PaaS, microservices, Edge/IoT=
...</p>
</li>
</ul>
