<p data-start=3D"6160" data-end=3D"6185">les responsables s=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6187" data-end=3D"6190">
<h3 data-start=3D"6192" data-end=3D"6234">=F0=9F=9B=A1=EF=B8=8F 4.2 Zones l=
ogiques (regroupements)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6236" data-end=3D"6280">Repr=C3=A9senter des <strong data-=
start=3D"6252" data-end=3D"6268">zones r=C3=A9seau</strong> permet de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6281" data-end=3D"6418">
<li data-start=3D"6281" data-end=3D"6334">
<p data-start=3D"6283" data-end=3D"6334">s=C3=A9parer la <strong data-start=
=3D"6294" data-end=3D"6301">DMZ</strong> (zone publique) du <strong data-st=
art=3D"6321" data-end=3D"6334">LAN priv=C3=A9</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6335" data-end=3D"6371">
<p data-start=3D"6337" data-end=3D"6371">regrouper des <strong data-start=
=3D"6351" data-end=3D"6371">ressources cloud</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6372" data-end=3D"6418">
<p data-start=3D"6374" data-end=3D"6418">illustrer une <strong data-start=
=3D"6388" data-end=3D"6418">architecture multi-r=C3=A9gions</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6420" data-end=3D"6484">UML ne d=C3=A9finit pas de notatio=
n stricte pour cela, mais on peut :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6485" data-end=3D"6596">
<li data-start=3D"6485" data-end=3D"6522">
<p data-start=3D"6487" data-end=3D"6522">utiliser des <strong data-start=3D=
"6500" data-end=3D"6522">bo=C3=AEtes englobantes</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6523" data-end=3D"6596">
<p data-start=3D"6525" data-end=3D"6596">annoter avec des st=C3=A9r=C3=A9ot=
ypes <code data-start=3D"6554" data-end=3D"6563">&lt;&lt;DMZ&gt;&gt;</code>=
, <code data-start=3D"6565" data-end=3D"6576">&lt;&lt;Cloud&gt;&gt;</code>,=
 <code data-start=3D"6578" data-end=3D"6590">&lt;&lt;Region&gt;&gt;</code>,=
 etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6598" data-end=3D"6601">
<h3 data-start=3D"6603" data-end=3D"6641">=F0=9F=8C=8D 4.3 Multi-cloud / mu=
lti-r=C3=A9gions</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6643" data-end=3D"6675">Avec les d=C3=A9ploiements moderne=
s :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6676" data-end=3D"6808">
<li data-start=3D"6676" data-end=3D"6740">
<p data-start=3D"6678" data-end=3D"6740">Vos services peuvent =C3=AAtre <st=
rong data-start=3D"6704" data-end=3D"6717">r=C3=A9pliqu=C3=A9s</strong> dan=
s plusieurs r=C3=A9gions</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6741" data-end=3D"6808">
<p data-start=3D"6743" data-end=3D"6808">Vous pouvez utiliser <strong data-=
start=3D"6764" data-end=3D"6790">plusieurs fournisseurs</strong> (AWS, GCP,=
 Azure)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"6810" data-end=3D"6833">Mod=C3=A9lisation UML :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6834" data-end=3D"6951">
<li data-start=3D"6834" data-end=3D"6874">
<p data-start=3D"6836" data-end=3D"6874">Utiliser plusieurs n=C5=93uds clou=
d group=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6875" data-end=3D"6907">
<p data-start=3D"6877" data-end=3D"6907">Relier les r=C3=A9gions entre elle=
s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6908" data-end=3D"6951">
<p data-start=3D"6910" data-end=3D"6951">Pr=C3=A9ciser la g=C3=A9olocalisat=
ion si n=C3=A9cessaire</p>
</li>
</ul>
