<li data-start=3D"936" data-end=3D"981">
<p data-start=3D"938" data-end=3D"981">La <strong data-start=3D"941" data-e=
nd=3D"980">clart=C3=A9 de l=E2=80=99architecture logicielle</strong>,</p>
