<h3 data-start=3D"1127" data-end=3D"1161">=F0=9F=93=A6 1.1 D=C3=A9finition =
d=E2=80=99un package</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1163" data-end=3D"1234">Un <strong data-start=3D"1166" dat=
a-end=3D"1181">package UML</strong> est un <strong data-start=3D"1189" data=
-end=3D"1210">=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment conteneur</strong>, capable de regrouper :<=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"1236" data-end=3D"1460">
<li data-start=3D"1236" data-end=3D"1328">
<p data-start=3D"1238" data-end=3D"1328">Des <strong data-start=3D"1242" da=
ta-end=3D"1253">classes</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"1255" data-end=3D"1=
269">interfaces</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"1271" data-end=3D"1285">com=
posants</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"1287" data-end=3D"1301">diagrammes<=
/strong>, ou d=E2=80=99autres <strong data-start=3D"1315" data-end=3D"1327"=
>packages</strong>,</p>
