<li data-start=3D"1329" data-end=3D"1460">
<p data-start=3D"1331" data-end=3D"1460">Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments inclus part=
agent souvent un <strong data-start=3D"1372" data-end=3D"1401">m=C3=AAme co=
ntexte fonctionnel</strong> (par exemple : <code data-start=3D"1417" data-e=
nd=3D"1433">UserManagement</code>, <code data-start=3D"1435" data-end=3D"14=
44">Billing</code>, <code data-start=3D"1446" data-end=3D"1452">Auth</code>=
, etc.).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1462" data-end=3D"1476"><strong data-start=3D"1462" data-e=
