<hr data-start=3D"2171" data-end=3D"2174">
<h3 data-start=3D"2176" data-end=3D"2211">=F0=9F=A7=AE 2.1 But de la modula=
risation</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2213" data-end=3D"2247">Une bonne organisation modulaire :=
</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2248" data-end=3D"2487">
<li data-start=3D"2248" data-end=3D"2282">
<p data-start=3D"2250" data-end=3D"2282">R=C3=A9duit les <strong data-start=
=3D"2261" data-end=3D"2281">interd=C3=A9pendances</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2283" data-end=3D"2327">
<p data-start=3D"2285" data-end=3D"2327">Facilite les <strong data-start=3D=
"2298" data-end=3D"2326">=C3=A9volutions ind=C3=A9pendantes</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2328" data-end=3D"2398">
<p data-start=3D"2330" data-end=3D"2398">Permet le <strong data-start=3D"23=
40" data-end=3D"2373">d=C3=A9coupage par responsabilit=C3=A9s</strong> (pri=
ncipe SRP du SOLID),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2399" data-end=3D"2487">
<p data-start=3D"2401" data-end=3D"2487">Encourage les architectures <stron=
g data-start=3D"2429" data-end=3D"2450">layered (couches)</strong> ou <stro=
ng data-start=3D"2454" data-end=3D"2486">hexagonales (ports/adapters)</stro=
ng>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
