<hr data-start=3D"5605" data-end=3D"5608">
<h3 data-start=3D"5610" data-end=3D"5659">=F0=9F=A7=AC 4.2 Nommage hi=C3=A9=
rarchique (style namespace)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5661" data-end=3D"5748">Les noms de packages peuvent refl=
=C3=A9ter une <strong data-start=3D"5703" data-end=3D"5737">structure hi=C3=
=A9rarchique logique</strong>, souvent :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5749" data-end=3D"5834">
<li data-start=3D"5749" data-end=3D"5790">
<p data-start=3D"5751" data-end=3D"5790">Bas=C3=A9e sur des <strong data-st=
art=3D"5765" data-end=3D"5790">domaines fonctionnels</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5791" data-end=3D"5834">
<p data-start=3D"5793" data-end=3D"5834">Ou sur des <strong data-start=3D"5=
804" data-end=3D"5834">espaces de noms techniques</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5836" data-end=3D"5851">Exemples :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5852" data-end=3D"5921">
<li data-start=3D"5852" data-end=3D"5873">
<p data-start=3D"5854" data-end=3D"5873"><code data-start=3D"5854" data-end=
=3D"5873">com.myapp.billing</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5874" data-end=3D"5898">
<p data-start=3D"5876" data-end=3D"5898"><code data-start=3D"5876" data-end=
=3D"5898">org.openbank.account</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5899" data-end=3D"5921">
<p data-start=3D"5901" data-end=3D"5921"><code data-start=3D"5901" data-end=
=3D"5921">app.auth.token.jwt</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5923" data-end=3D"5926">
<h3 data-start=3D"5928" data-end=3D"5964">=E2=9A=96=EF=B8=8F 4.3 Visibilit=
=C3=A9 entre packages</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5966" data-end=3D"6009">Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dans un pac=
kage peuvent =C3=AAtre :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6010" data-end=3D"6125">
<li data-start=3D"6010" data-end=3D"6057">
<p data-start=3D"6012" data-end=3D"6057"><code data-start=3D"6012" data-end=
=3D"6020">public</code> : accessibles par d=E2=80=99autres packages,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6058" data-end=3D"6125">
<p data-start=3D"6060" data-end=3D"6125"><code data-start=3D"6060" data-end=
=3D"6077">package-private</code> : uniquement visibles dans leur propre pac=
kage.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6127" data-end=3D"6187">Cela permet d=E2=80=99<strong data=
-start=3D"6141" data-end=3D"6155">encapsuler</strong> certaines classes ou =
fonctions.</p>
