<hr data-start=3D"248" data-end=3D"251">
<h1 data-start=3D"253" data-end=3D"294">=F0=9F=A7=AC Tutoriel UML =E2=80=94=
 Diagramme de Profil</h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"295" data-end=3D"365">Th=C3=A8me : St=C3=A9r=C3=A9otypes,=
 Extensions UML, Personnalisation du m=C3=A9tamod=C3=A8le</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"367" data-end=3D"370">
<h2 data-start=3D"372" data-end=3D"390">=F0=9F=A7=AD Introduction</h2>
<p data-start=3D"392" data-end=3D"571">Le <strong data-start=3D"395" data-e=
nd=3D"422">diagramme de profil UML</strong> (UML Profile Diagram) est un <s=
trong data-start=3D"452" data-end=3D"486">m=C3=A9canisme d=E2=80=99extensio=
n officiel</strong> de la norme UML permettant d=E2=80=99<strong data-start=
=3D"516" data-end=3D"559">adapter UML =C3=A0 des contextes sp=C3=A9cifiques=
</strong>, tels que :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"573" data-end=3D"765">
<li data-start=3D"573" data-end=3D"618">
<p data-start=3D"575" data-end=3D"618">M=C3=A9tiers (banque, sant=C3=A9, t=
=C3=A9l=C3=A9com, industrie)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"619" data-end=3D"667">
<p data-start=3D"621" data-end=3D"667">M=C3=A9thodologies (SysML, MARTE, Do=
DAF, ArchiMate)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"668" data-end=3D"715">
<p data-start=3D"670" data-end=3D"715">Technologies (JEE, SOA, microservice=
s, cloud)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"716" data-end=3D"765">
<p data-start=3D"718" data-end=3D"765">Contraintes (temps r=C3=A9el, s=C3=
=A9curit=C3=A9, performance)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"767" data-end=3D"884">C=E2=80=99est l=E2=80=99outil de pr=
=C3=A9dilection pour <strong data-start=3D"802" data-end=3D"860">personnali=
ser UML sans modifier son m=C3=A9tamod=C3=A8le de base</strong>, via l=E2=
=80=99utilisation de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"886" data-end=3D"1012">
<li data-start=3D"886" data-end=3D"915">
<p data-start=3D"888" data-end=3D"915"><strong data-start=3D"888" data-end=
=3D"903">St=C3=A9r=C3=A9otypes</strong> (<code data-start=3D"905" data-end=
=3D"914">&lt;&lt;...&gt;&gt;</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"916" data-end=3D"958">
<p data-start=3D"918" data-end=3D"958"><strong data-start=3D"918" data-end=
=3D"940">Valeurs =C3=A9tiquet=C3=A9es</strong> (<em data-start=3D"942" data=
-end=3D"957">tagged values</em>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"959" data-end=3D"976">
<p data-start=3D"961" data-end=3D"976"><strong data-start=3D"961" data-end=
=3D"976">Contraintes</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"977" data-end=3D"1012">
<p data-start=3D"979" data-end=3D"1012"><strong data-start=3D"979" data-end=
=3D"1012">Extensions de m=C3=A9taclasses UML</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1014" data-end=3D"1017">
<h2 data-start=3D"1019" data-end=3D"1034">=F0=9F=8E=AF Objectifs</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"1036" data-end=3D"1256">
<li data-start=3D"1036" data-end=3D"1085">
<p data-start=3D"1038" data-end=3D"1085">Comprendre l=E2=80=99<strong data-=
start=3D"1051" data-end=3D"1085">utilit=C3=A9 du diagramme de profil</stron=
g></p>
