<li data-start=3D"1086" data-end=3D"1138">
<p data-start=3D"1088" data-end=3D"1138">Apprendre =C3=A0 <strong data-star=
t=3D"1100" data-end=3D"1138">cr=C3=A9er et appliquer des st=C3=A9r=C3=A9oty=
pes</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1139" data-end=3D"1192">
<p data-start=3D"1141" data-end=3D"1192">=C3=89tendre les <strong data-star=
t=3D"1153" data-end=3D"1172">m=C3=A9taclasses UML</strong> de mani=C3=A8re =
formelle</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1193" data-end=3D"1256">
<p data-start=3D"1195" data-end=3D"1256">Cr=C3=A9er des <strong data-start=
=3D"1205" data-end=3D"1230">profils r=C3=A9utilisables</strong> pour diff=
=C3=A9rents contextes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1258" data-end=3D"1261">
<h2 data-start=3D"1263" data-end=3D"1313">=F0=9F=94=B0 1. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce=
 qu=E2=80=99un diagramme de profil UML ?</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"1315" data-end=3D"1318">
<h3 data-start=3D"1320" data-end=3D"1337">=F0=9F=94=8D D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1339" data-end=3D"1485">Un <strong data-start=3D"1342" dat=
a-end=3D"1356">profil UML</strong> est un <strong data-start=3D"1364" data-=
end=3D"1404">paquetage st=C3=A9r=C3=A9otyp=C3=A9 (<code data-start=3D"1388"=
 data-end=3D"1401">&lt;&lt;profile&gt;&gt;</code>)</strong> qui d=C3=A9fini=
t un <strong data-start=3D"1420" data-end=3D"1446">vocabulaire sp=C3=A9cial=
is=C3=A9</strong> bas=C3=A9 sur UML standard, permettant de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1487" data-end=3D"1727">
<li data-start=3D"1487" data-end=3D"1584">
<p data-start=3D"1489" data-end=3D"1584"><strong data-start=3D"1489" data-e=
nd=3D"1514">Cr=C3=A9er des st=C3=A9r=C3=A9otypes</strong> : sortes d=E2=80=
=99annotations qui ajoutent du <strong data-start=3D"1554" data-end=3D"1584=
">sens s=C3=A9mantique sp=C3=A9cifique</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1585" data-end=3D"1644">
<p data-start=3D"1587" data-end=3D"1644"><strong data-start=3D"1587" data-e=
nd=3D"1628">Ajouter des propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s personnalis=C3=A9es</strong> (=
tagged values)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1645" data-end=3D"1681">
<p data-start=3D"1647" data-end=3D"1681"><strong data-start=3D"1647" data-e=
nd=3D"1681">Imposer des contraintes m=C3=A9tier</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1682" data-end=3D"1727">
<p data-start=3D"1684" data-end=3D"1727"><strong data-start=3D"1684" data-e=
nd=3D"1727">Restreindre ou enrichir la mod=C3=A9lisation</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1729" data-end=3D"1732">
<h3 data-start=3D"1734" data-end=3D"1783">=F0=9F=A7=AA Pourquoi ne pas modi=
fier UML directement ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1785" data-end=3D"1861">Parce qu=E2=80=99UML est un <stron=
g data-start=3D"1805" data-end=3D"1831">m=C3=A9tamod=C3=A8le standardis=C3=
=A9</strong>, toute modification directe :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1863" data-end=3D"1990">
<li data-start=3D"1863" data-end=3D"1894">
<p data-start=3D"1865" data-end=3D"1894">Ruinerait l=E2=80=99interop=C3=A9r=
abilit=C3=A9,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1895" data-end=3D"1943">
<p data-start=3D"1897" data-end=3D"1943">Romprait la compatibilit=C3=A9 ave=
c les outils UML,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1944" data-end=3D"1990">
<p data-start=3D"1946" data-end=3D"1990">Rendrait les mod=C3=A8les difficil=
es =C3=A0 maintenir.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1992" data-end=3D"2091">Les <strong data-start=3D"1996" da=
ta-end=3D"2011">profils UML</strong> contournent ce probl=C3=A8me via une <=
strong data-start=3D"2044" data-end=3D"2063">extension douce</strong>, 100%=
 conforme au standard.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2093" data-end=3D"2096">
<h2 data-start=3D"2098" data-end=3D"2155">=F0=9F=A7=B1 2. Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9=
ments fondamentaux du diagramme de profil</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"2157" data-end=3D"2160">
<h3 data-start=3D"2162" data-end=3D"2200">=F0=9F=A7=AC 2.1 St=C3=A9r=C3=A9o=
type (<code data-start=3D"2185" data-end=3D"2199">=C2=ABstereotype=C2=BB</c=
ode>)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2202" data-end=3D"2307">Un <strong data-start=3D"2205" dat=
a-end=3D"2219">st=C3=A9r=C3=A9otype</strong> est une <strong data-start=3D"=
2228" data-end=3D"2263">sp=C3=A9cialisation d=E2=80=99un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment =
UML</strong> (comme classe, composant, interface, etc.).</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2309" data-end=3D"2384">
<li data-start=3D"2309" data-end=3D"2342">
<p data-start=3D"2311" data-end=3D"2342">Syntaxe : <code data-start=3D"2321=
" data-end=3D"2342">&lt;&lt;NomDuSt=C3=A9r=C3=A9otype&gt;&gt;</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2343" data-end=3D"2384">
<p data-start=3D"2345" data-end=3D"2384">Peut =C3=AAtre visuel, symbolique =
ou textuel</p>
</li>
</ul>
