<hr data-start=3D"7198" data-end=3D"7201">
<h2 data-start=3D"7203" data-end=3D"7260">=F0=9F=A7=A0 8. Niveau expert : m=
=C3=A9tamod=C3=A9lisation &amp; extension UML</h2>
<p data-start=3D"7262" data-end=3D"7350">Un <strong data-start=3D"7265" dat=
a-end=3D"7279">profil UML</strong> ne modifie pas le <strong data-start=3D"=
7298" data-end=3D"7316">m=C3=A9tamod=C3=A8le UML</strong>, mais l=E2=80=99<=
strong data-start=3D"7325" data-end=3D"7349">=C3=A9tend temporairement</str=
ong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"7352" data-end=3D"7391">La <strong data-start=3D"7355" dat=
a-end=3D"7379">relation "extension"</strong> permet de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7392" data-end=3D"7506">
<li data-start=3D"7392" data-end=3D"7451">
<p data-start=3D"7394" data-end=3D"7451">Lier dynamiquement un st=C3=A9r=C3=
=A9otype =C3=A0 une <strong data-start=3D"7433" data-end=3D"7451">m=C3=A9ta=
classe UML</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7452" data-end=3D"7506">
<p data-start=3D"7454" data-end=3D"7506">Appliquer le principe de <strong d=
ata-start=3D"7479" data-end=3D"7506">m=C3=A9tamod=C3=A9lisation l=C3=A9g=C3=
=A8re</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7508" data-end=3D"7531">Cela ouvre la porte =C3=A0 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7532" data-end=3D"7710">
<li data-start=3D"7532" data-end=3D"7606">
<p data-start=3D"7534" data-end=3D"7606">Des <strong data-start=3D"7538" da=
ta-end=3D"7562">domaines sp=C3=A9cifiques</strong> (ex : bioinformatique, i=
ndustrie nucl=C3=A9aire)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7607" data-end=3D"7653">
<p data-start=3D"7609" data-end=3D"7653">Des <strong data-start=3D"7613" da=
ta-end=3D"7633">langages d=C3=A9riv=C3=A9s</strong> (DSL bas=C3=A9s sur UML=
)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7654" data-end=3D"7710">
<p data-start=3D"7656" data-end=3D"7710">La <strong data-start=3D"7659" dat=
a-end=3D"7710">g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ration de code ou documentation automatis=C3=
=A9e</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7712" data-end=3D"7715">
<h2 data-start=3D"7717" data-end=3D"7733">=F0=9F=8E=93 Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"7735" data-end=3D"7813">Le <strong data-start=3D"7738" dat=
a-end=3D"7765">diagramme de profil UML</strong> est un <strong data-start=
=3D"7773" data-end=3D"7806">outil avanc=C3=A9 mais fondamental</strong> pou=
r :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7815" data-end=3D"7980">
<li data-start=3D"7815" data-end=3D"7865">
<p data-start=3D"7817" data-end=3D"7865"><strong data-start=3D"7817" data-e=
nd=3D"7865">Adapter UML aux besoins m=C3=A9tier ou techniques</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7866" data-end=3D"7917">
<p data-start=3D"7868" data-end=3D"7917">Garantir une <strong data-start=3D=
"7881" data-end=3D"7917">sp=C3=A9cification claire et formelle</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7918" data-end=3D"7980">
<p data-start=3D"7920" data-end=3D"7980">Pr=C3=A9parer des <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"7933" data-end=3D"7953">mod=C3=A8les enrichis</strong>, r=C3=A9utilis=
ables et robustes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7982" data-end=3D"8145">Sa ma=C3=AEtrise est indispensable=
 dans les projets d=E2=80=99envergure, l=E2=80=99ing=C3=A9nierie des syst=
=C3=A8mes, ou les domaines =C3=A0 forte sp=C3=A9cialisation (d=C3=A9fense, =
a=C3=A9ronautique, sant=C3=A9, etc.).</p>
<hr data-start=3D"8147" data-end=3D"8150">
<p data-start=3D"8152" data-end=3D"8168">Souhaitez-vous :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8169" data-end=3D"8433">
<li data-start=3D"8169" data-end=3D"8251">
<p data-start=3D"8171" data-end=3D"8251">Un <strong data-start=3D"8174" dat=
a-end=3D"8249">exemple complet de profil UML avec st=C3=A9r=C3=A9otypes, pr=
opri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s, contraintes</strong> ?</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8252" data-end=3D"8342">
<p data-start=3D"8254" data-end=3D"8342">Un <strong data-start=3D"8257" dat=
a-end=3D"8279">mod=C3=A8le UML complet</strong> =C3=A0 partir d=E2=80=99un =
<strong data-start=3D"8294" data-end=3D"8309">projet r=C3=A9el</strong> ou =
une architecture logicielle ?</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8343" data-end=3D"8433">
<p data-start=3D"8345" data-end=3D"8433">Une <strong data-start=3D"8349" da=
