=3D"164">Voici un <strong data-start=3D"9" data-end=3D"43">tutoriel complet=
 et approfondi</strong> sur le <strong data-start=3D"51" data-end=3D"96">Di=
agramme de Cas d=E2=80=99Utilisation (Use Case)</strong> en UML, allant du =
<strong data-start=3D"115" data-end=3D"143">niveau d=C3=A9butant =C3=A0 exp=
ert</strong>, avec un focus sur :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"166" data-end=3D"339">
<li data-start=3D"166" data-end=3D"214">
<p data-start=3D"168" data-end=3D"214">Les <strong data-start=3D"172" data-=
end=3D"183">acteurs</strong> et les <strong data-start=3D"191" data-end=3D"=
212">cas d'utilisation</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"215" data-end=3D"288">
<p data-start=3D"217" data-end=3D"288">Les <strong data-start=3D"221" data-=
end=3D"234">relations</strong> fondamentales (<code data-start=3D"250" data=
-end=3D"259">include</code>, <code data-start=3D"261" data-end=3D"269">exte=
nd</code>, g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralisation)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"289" data-end=3D"339">
<p data-start=3D"291" data-end=3D"339">La <strong data-start=3D"294" data-e=
nd=3D"339">mod=C3=A9lisation des exigences fonctionnelles</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"341" data-end=3D"344">
<h1 data-start=3D"346" data-end=3D"406">=F0=9F=8E=AD UML =E2=80=93 Diagramm=
e de Cas d=E2=80=99Utilisation (Use Case Diagram)</h1>
<hr data-start=3D"408" data-end=3D"411">
<h2 data-start=3D"413" data-end=3D"439">=F0=9F=8E=AF Objectif du tutoriel</=
h2>
<p data-start=3D"441" data-end=3D"461">Ce tutoriel vise =C3=A0 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"463" data-end=3D"868">
<li data-start=3D"463" data-end=3D"541">
<p data-start=3D"465" data-end=3D"541">Comprendre le r=C3=B4le des <strong =
data-start=3D"488" data-end=3D"509">cas d'utilisation</strong> dans l'ing=
=C3=A9nierie des exigences</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"542" data-end=3D"594">
<p data-start=3D"544" data-end=3D"594">Identifier et mod=C3=A9liser les <st=
rong data-start=3D"572" data-end=3D"583">acteurs</strong> du syst=C3=A8me</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"595" data-end=3D"699">
<p data-start=3D"597" data-end=3D"699">Utiliser les relations <code data-st=
art=3D"620" data-end=3D"629">include</code>, <code data-start=3D"631" data-=
end=3D"639">extend</code>, et la g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralisation pour structurer l=
es cas d'utilisation</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"700" data-end=3D"783">
<p data-start=3D"702" data-end=3D"783">Distinguer les <strong data-start=3D=
"717" data-end=3D"745">exigences fonctionnelles</strong> =C3=A0 travers un =
langage graphique simple</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"784" data-end=3D"868">
<p data-start=3D"786" data-end=3D"868">Passer de la <strong data-start=3D"7=
99" data-end=3D"834">mod=C3=A9lisation des besoins m=C3=A9tier</strong> =C3=
=A0 la <strong data-start=3D"840" data-end=3D"868">sp=C3=A9cification logic=
ielle</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"870" data-end=3D"873">
<h2 data-start=3D"875" data-end=3D"930">=F0=9F=93=98 1. Introduction au dia=
gramme de cas d'utilisation</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"932" data-end=3D"935">
<h3 data-start=3D"937" data-end=3D"992">=F0=9F=94=8D Qu=E2=80=99est-ce qu=
=E2=80=99un diagramme de cas d=E2=80=99utilisation ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"994" data-end=3D"1210">Le <strong data-start=3D"997" data-=
end=3D"1031">diagramme de cas d=E2=80=99utilisation</strong> est un <strong=
 data-start=3D"1039" data-end=3D"1071">diagramme comportemental UML</strong=
> qui d=C3=A9crit <strong data-start=3D"1083" data-end=3D"1135">les interac=
tions entre les acteurs et un syst=C3=A8me</strong> =C3=A0 travers des <str=
ong data-start=3D"1150" data-end=3D"1171">cas d=E2=80=99utilisation</strong=
> (use cases). Il r=C3=A9pond =C3=A0 la question :</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"1212" data-end=3D"1259">
<p data-start=3D"1214" data-end=3D"1259">"Que fait le syst=C3=A8me pour ses=
 utilisateurs ?"</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"1261" data-end=3D"1381">C=E2=80=99est un outil de <strong =
data-start=3D"1279" data-end=3D"1324">communication entre les parties prena=
ntes</strong> (clients, d=C3=A9veloppeurs, analystes, utilisateurs finaux).=
</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1383" data-end=3D"1386">
<h3 data-start=3D"1388" data-end=3D"1411">=F0=9F=A7=B0 =C3=80 quoi sert-il =
?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1413" data-end=3D"1673">
<li data-start=3D"1413" data-end=3D"1457">
<p data-start=3D"1415" data-end=3D"1457">Sp=C3=A9cifier les <strong data-st=
art=3D"1429" data-end=3D"1457">exigences fonctionnelles</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1458" data-end=3D"1500">
<p data-start=3D"1460" data-end=3D"1500">Identifier les <strong data-start=
=3D"1475" data-end=3D"1500">fronti=C3=A8res du syst=C3=A8me</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1501" data-end=3D"1546">
<p data-start=3D"1503" data-end=3D"1546">Aider =C3=A0 la <strong data-start=
=3D"1514" data-end=3D"1546">mod=C3=A9lisation orient=C3=A9e m=C3=A9tier</st=
rong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1547" data-end=3D"1591">
<p data-start=3D"1549" data-end=3D"1591">Servir de base aux <strong data-st=
art=3D"1568" data-end=3D"1591">tests d'acceptation</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1592" data-end=3D"1673">
<p data-start=3D"1594" data-end=3D"1673">Documenter les <strong data-start=
=3D"1609" data-end=3D"1633">besoins utilisateurs</strong> sans entrer dans =
les d=C3=A9tails techniques</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1675" data-end=3D"1678">
<h2 data-start=3D"1680" data-end=3D"1700">=F0=9F=91=A4 2. Les Acteurs</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"1702" data-end=3D"1705">
<h3 data-start=3D"1707" data-end=3D"1724">=F0=9F=A7=8D D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1726" data-end=3D"1860">Un <strong data-start=3D"1729" dat=
a-end=3D"1739">acteur</strong> est <strong data-start=3D"1744" data-end=3D"=
1777">une entit=C3=A9 externe au syst=C3=A8me</strong> qui <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1782" data-end=3D"1795">interagit</strong> avec lui pour <strong data=
-start=3D"1810" data-end=3D"1835">accomplir un objectif</strong>.<br data-s=
tart=3D"1836" data-end=3D"1839">
Un acteur peut =C3=AAtre :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1862" data-end=3D"1993">
<li data-start=3D"1862" data-end=3D"1914">
<p data-start=3D"1864" data-end=3D"1914">Une personne (Utilisateur, Client,=
 Administrateur)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1915" data-end=3D"1952">
<p data-start=3D"1917" data-end=3D"1952">Un autre syst=C3=A8me (API, Servic=
e Web)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1953" data-end=3D"1993">
<p data-start=3D"1955" data-end=3D"1993">Une organisation (Banque, Fourniss=
eur)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1995" data-end=3D"2100">Un acteur <strong data-start=3D"20=
05" data-end=3D"2043">n=E2=80=99est pas =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99int=C3=A9rieur du =
syst=C3=A8me</strong>, mais il <strong data-start=3D"2053" data-end=3D"2099=
">initie ou participe =C3=A0 un cas d=E2=80=99utilisation</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2102" data-end=3D"2105">
