ong data-start=3D"7624" data-end=3D"7661">porte d=E2=80=99entr=C3=A9e natur=
elle dans UML</strong>. Il :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7669" data-end=3D"7902">
<li data-start=3D"7669" data-end=3D"7732">
<p data-start=3D"7671" data-end=3D"7732">Permet d=E2=80=99<strong data-star=
