<h3 data-start=3D"3252" data-end=3D"3298">Pourquoi structurer un langage "n=
aturel" ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3300" data-end=3D"3464">Pour que les <strong data-start=3D=
"3313" data-end=3D"3332">non-techniciens</strong> comprennent et valident l=
es exigences, il est important d=E2=80=99utiliser un <strong data-start=3D"=
3403" data-end=3D"3463">langage clair, accessible, mais rigoureusement stru=
ctur=C3=A9</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3466" data-end=3D"3478">Ce langage :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3480" data-end=3D"3714">
