d=3D"121">Voici un tutoriel complet et approfondi sur le <strong data-start=
=3D"47" data-end=3D"76">Diagramme d=E2=80=99Activit=C3=A9s UML</strong>, fo=
calis=C3=A9 sur les concepts cl=C3=A9s suivants :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"122" data-end=3D"239">
<li data-start=3D"122" data-end=3D"156">
<p data-start=3D"124" data-end=3D"156"><strong data-start=3D"124" data-end=
=3D"154">Flux de travail (workflow)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"157" data-end=3D"197">
<p data-start=3D"159" data-end=3D"197"><strong data-start=3D"159" data-end=
=3D"195">Actions, d=C3=A9cisions, bifurcations</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"198" data-end=3D"239">
<p data-start=3D"200" data-end=3D"239"><strong data-start=3D"200" data-end=
=3D"237">Swimlanes (r=C3=B4les ou d=C3=A9partements)</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"241" data-end=3D"361">Ce tutoriel couvre tout, du niveau d=
=C3=A9butant =C3=A0 expert, avec explications claires, exemples concrets, e=
t bonnes pratiques.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"363" data-end=3D"366">
<h1 data-start=3D"368" data-end=3D"411">=F0=9F=93=98 Tutoriel UML =E2=80=93=
 Diagramme d=E2=80=99Activit=C3=A9s</h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"412" data-end=3D"473">Concepts cl=C3=A9s : Workflow, Acti=
ons, D=C3=A9cisions, Swimlanes</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"474" data-end=3D"477">
<h2 data-start=3D"479" data-end=3D"522">1. Introduction au diagramme d=E2=
=80=99activit=C3=A9s</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"524" data-end=3D"527">
<h3 data-start=3D"529" data-end=3D"572">Qu=E2=80=99est-ce qu=E2=80=99un dia=
gramme d=E2=80=99activit=C3=A9s ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"574" data-end=3D"772">Le <strong data-start=3D"577" data-e=
nd=3D"602">diagramme d=E2=80=99activit=C3=A9s</strong> est un type de diagr=
amme comportemental UML qui sert =C3=A0 mod=C3=A9liser des <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"672" data-end=3D"693">processus m=C3=A9tiers</strong>, des <strong da=
ta-start=3D"699" data-end=3D"729">flux de travail (workflow)</strong>, ou l=
a <strong data-start=3D"737" data-end=3D"769">logique interne d=E2=80=99un =
syst=C3=A8me</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"774" data-end=3D"868">Il d=C3=A9crit <strong data-start=3D=
"784" data-end=3D"820">les =C3=A9tapes successives (actions)</strong> et le=
s <strong data-start=3D"828" data-end=3D"849">choix (d=C3=A9cisions)</stron=
g> dans un processus.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"870" data-end=3D"873">
<h3 data-start=3D"875" data-end=3D"899">Utilit=C3=A9s principales</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"901" data-end=3D"1224">
<li data-start=3D"901" data-end=3D"962">
<p data-start=3D"903" data-end=3D"962">Visualiser le <strong data-start=3D"=
917" data-end=3D"951">workflow d=E2=80=99une activit=C3=A9 m=C3=A9tier</str=
ong> ou syst=C3=A8me</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"963" data-end=3D"1028">
<p data-start=3D"965" data-end=3D"1028">Montrer la <strong data-start=3D"97=
6" data-end=3D"1002">logique conditionnelle</strong> (d=C3=A9cisions, bifur=
cations)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1029" data-end=3D"1096">
<p data-start=3D"1031" data-end=3D"1096">Mettre en lumi=C3=A8re la <strong =
data-start=3D"1052" data-end=3D"1078">r=C3=A9partition des t=C3=A2ches</str=
ong> via les swimlanes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1097" data-end=3D"1155">
<p data-start=3D"1099" data-end=3D"1155">Aider =C3=A0 comprendre, analyser =
et optimiser un processus</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1156" data-end=3D"1224">
<p data-start=3D"1158" data-end=3D"1224">Servir de base =C3=A0 la conceptio=
n ou =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99automatisation des processus</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1226" data-end=3D"1229">
<h2 data-start=3D"1231" data-end=3D"1283">2. Concepts fondamentaux du diagr=
amme d=E2=80=99activit=C3=A9s</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"1285" data-end=3D"1288">
<h3 data-start=3D"1290" data-end=3D"1306">2.1. Actions</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"1308" data-end=3D"1311">
<h4 data-start=3D"1313" data-end=3D"1328">D=C3=A9finition</h4>
<p data-start=3D"1330" data-end=3D"1459">Une <strong data-start=3D"1334" da=
ta-end=3D"1344">action</strong> repr=C3=A9sente une <strong data-start=3D"1=
360" data-end=3D"1384">activit=C3=A9 =C3=A9l=C3=A9mentaire</strong> ou un <=
strong data-start=3D"1391" data-end=3D"1398">pas</strong> dans un processus=
. C=E2=80=99est une t=C3=A2che ou un traitement r=C3=A9alis=C3=A9.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1461" data-end=3D"1464">
<h4 data-start=3D"1466" data-end=3D"1483">Notation UML</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"1485" data-end=3D"1601">
<li data-start=3D"1485" data-end=3D"1529">
<p data-start=3D"1487" data-end=3D"1529">Repr=C3=A9sent=C3=A9e par un <stro=
ng data-start=3D"1506" data-end=3D"1527">rectangle arrondi</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1530" data-end=3D"1601">
<p data-start=3D"1532" data-end=3D"1601">Peut contenir un texte d=C3=A9criv=
ant l=E2=80=99action, ex : "Valider la commande"</p>
</li>
</ul>
