<hr data-start=3D"2646" data-end=3D"2649">
<h3 data-start=3D"2651" data-end=3D"2674">2.4. Fusion (merge)</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"2676" data-end=3D"2679">
<ul data-start=3D"2681" data-end=3D"2842">
<li data-start=3D"2681" data-end=3D"2749">
<p data-start=3D"2683" data-end=3D"2749">Point o=C3=B9 plusieurs flux alter=
natifs se <strong data-start=3D"2722" data-end=3D"2736">rejoignent</strong>=
 en un seul</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2750" data-end=3D"2814">
<p data-start=3D"2752" data-end=3D"2814">Repr=C3=A9sent=C3=A9 par un <stron=
g data-start=3D"2770" data-end=3D"2781">losange</strong> identique au point=
 de d=C3=A9cision</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2815" data-end=3D"2842">
<p data-start=3D"2817" data-end=3D"2842">Pas de condition associ=C3=A9e</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2844" data-end=3D"2847">
<h3 data-start=3D"2849" data-end=3D"2870">2.5. D=C3=A9but et fin</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"2872" data-end=3D"2875">
<ul data-start=3D"2877" data-end=3D"2989">
<li data-start=3D"2877" data-end=3D"2920">
<p data-start=3D"2879" data-end=3D"2920"><strong data-start=3D"2879" data-e=
nd=3D"2895">N=C5=93ud initial</strong> : un cercle noir plein</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2921" data-end=3D"2989">
<p data-start=3D"2923" data-end=3D"2989"><strong data-start=3D"2923" data-e=
nd=3D"2937">N=C5=93ud final</strong> : un cercle noir avec un cercle plus g=
rand autour</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2991" data-end=3D"3047">Ils d=C3=A9limitent le d=C3=A9but =
et la fin du processus mod=C3=A9lis=C3=A9.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3049" data-end=3D"3052">
<h2 data-start=3D"3054" data-end=3D"3092">3. Swimlanes (piscines et couloir=
s)</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"3094" data-end=3D"3097">
<h3 data-start=3D"3099" data-end=3D"3118">3.1. D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3120" data-end=3D"3253">Les <strong data-start=3D"3124" da=
ta-end=3D"3137">swimlanes</strong> sont des <strong data-start=3D"3147" dat=
a-end=3D"3183">zones horizontales ou verticales</strong> qui divisent le di=
agramme pour montrer <strong data-start=3D"3223" data-end=3D"3252">qui r=C3=
=A9alise chaque action</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3255" data-end=3D"3347">Elles correspondent souvent =C3=A0=
 des <strong data-start=3D"3289" data-end=3D"3298">r=C3=B4les</strong>, <st=
rong data-start=3D"3300" data-end=3D"3313">personnes</strong>, <strong data=
-start=3D"3315" data-end=3D"3326">=C3=A9quipes</strong> ou <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"3330" data-end=3D"3346">d=C3=A9partements</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3349" data-end=3D"3352">
<h3 data-start=3D"3354" data-end=3D"3396">3.2. Pourquoi utiliser les swimla=
nes ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3398" data-end=3D"3643">
<li data-start=3D"3398" data-end=3D"3450">
<p data-start=3D"3400" data-end=3D"3450">Clarifier la <strong data-start=3D=
"3413" data-end=3D"3448">r=C3=A9partition des responsabilit=C3=A9s</strong>=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3451" data-end=3D"3511">
<p data-start=3D"3453" data-end=3D"3511">Identifier les <strong data-start=
=3D"3468" data-end=3D"3509">interactions inter-organisationnelles</strong><=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3512" data-end=3D"3578">
<p data-start=3D"3514" data-end=3D"3578">Faciliter la communication entre =
=C3=A9quipes m=C3=A9tiers et techniques</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3579" data-end=3D"3643">
<p data-start=3D"3581" data-end=3D"3643">Optimiser les processus en rep=C3=
=A9rant les goulots d=E2=80=99=C3=A9tranglement</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3645" data-end=3D"3648">
<h3 data-start=3D"3650" data-end=3D"3671">3.3. Notation UML</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3673" data-end=3D"3925">
<li data-start=3D"3673" data-end=3D"3773">
<p data-start=3D"3675" data-end=3D"3773">Le diagramme est divis=C3=A9 en <s=
trong data-start=3D"3702" data-end=3D"3722">piscines (pools)</strong>, elle=
s-m=C3=AAmes subdivis=C3=A9es en <strong data-start=3D"3751" data-end=3D"37=
71">couloirs (lanes)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3774" data-end=3D"3841">
<p data-start=3D"3776" data-end=3D"3841">Chaque couloir est nomm=C3=A9 (ex.=
 : "Service Client", "Logistique")</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3842" data-end=3D"3925">
<p data-start=3D"3844" data-end=3D"3925">Les actions sont plac=C3=A9es dans=
 le couloir correspondant =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99entit=C3=A9 qui les ex=C3=A9cute=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3927" data-end=3D"3930">
<h3 data-start=3D"3932" data-end=3D"3948">3.4. Exemple</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3950" data-end=3D"4001">Imaginez un processus de gestion d=
e r=C3=A9clamation :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4003" data-end=3D"4069">
<li data-start=3D"4003" data-end=3D"4034">
<p data-start=3D"4005" data-end=3D"4034">Swimlane 1 : Service client</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4035" data-end=3D"4069">
<p data-start=3D"4037" data-end=3D"4069">Swimlane 2 : Service technique</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4071" data-end=3D"4120">Les actions sont r=C3=A9parties se=
lon qui les r=C3=A9alise.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4122" data-end=3D"4125">
<h2 data-start=3D"4127" data-end=3D"4191">4. Construction d=E2=80=99un diag=
ramme d=E2=80=99activit=C3=A9s : =C3=A9tapes pratiques</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"4193" data-end=3D"4196">
<h3 data-start=3D"4198" data-end=3D"4242">4.1. Identifier le processus =C3=
=A0 mod=C3=A9liser</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4244" data-end=3D"4318">
<li data-start=3D"4244" data-end=3D"4281">
<p data-start=3D"4246" data-end=3D"4281">Quel est le <strong data-start=3D"=
4258" data-end=3D"4277">objectif m=C3=A9tier</strong> ?</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4282" data-end=3D"4318">
<p data-start=3D"4284" data-end=3D"4318">Quelles sont les <strong data-star=
t=3D"4301" data-end=3D"4316">=C3=A9tapes cl=C3=A9s</strong> ?</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4320" data-end=3D"4323">
<h3 data-start=3D"4325" data-end=3D"4373">4.2. D=C3=A9finir les acteurs / r=
=C3=B4les (swimlanes)</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4375" data-end=3D"4447">
<li data-start=3D"4375" data-end=3D"4405">
<p data-start=3D"4377" data-end=3D"4405">Qui r=C3=A9alise chaque t=C3=A2che=
 ?</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4406" data-end=3D"4447">
<p data-start=3D"4408" data-end=3D"4447">Cr=C3=A9er une swimlane par r=C3=
=B4le/d=C3=A9partement</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4449" data-end=3D"4452">
<h3 data-start=3D"4454" data-end=3D"4494">4.3. Lister les actions =C3=A9l=
=C3=A9mentaires</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4496" data-end=3D"4579">
<li data-start=3D"4496" data-end=3D"4530">
<p data-start=3D"4498" data-end=3D"4530">Que fait-on, =C3=A9tape par =C3=A9=
tape ?</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4531" data-end=3D"4579">
<p data-start=3D"4533" data-end=3D"4579">Formuler les actions de fa=C3=A7on=
 simple et claire</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4581" data-end=3D"4584">
<h3 data-start=3D"4586" data-end=3D"4630">4.4. D=C3=A9finir les d=C3=A9cisi=
ons et conditions</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4632" data-end=3D"4719">
<li data-start=3D"4632" data-end=3D"4667">
<p data-start=3D"4634" data-end=3D"4667">O=C3=B9 les choix apparaissent-ils=
