<hr data-start=3D"6671" data-end=3D"6674">
<h2 data-start=3D"6676" data-end=3D"6698">6. Concepts avanc=C3=A9s</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"6700" data-end=3D"6703">
<h3 data-start=3D"6705" data-end=3D"6750">6.1. Activit=C3=A9s concurrentes =
(fork / join)</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6752" data-end=3D"6890">
<li data-start=3D"6752" data-end=3D"6816">
<p data-start=3D"6754" data-end=3D"6816"><strong data-start=3D"6754" data-e=
nd=3D"6762">Fork</strong> : un flux se divise en plusieurs actions parall=
=C3=A8les</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6817" data-end=3D"6890">
<p data-start=3D"6819" data-end=3D"6890"><strong data-start=3D"6819" data-e=
nd=3D"6827">Join</strong> : plusieurs flux parall=C3=A8les se rejoignent av=
ant de continuer</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6892" data-end=3D"6958">Notation : un <strong data-start=
=3D"6906" data-end=3D"6925">rectangle large</strong> (barre horizontale ou =
verticale)</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6960" data-end=3D"6963">
<h3 data-start=3D"6965" data-end=3D"7003">6.2. Actions r=C3=A9currentes (bo=
ucles)</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7005" data-end=3D"7116">
<li data-start=3D"7005" data-end=3D"7061">
<p data-start=3D"7007" data-end=3D"7061">Boucles exprim=C3=A9es via des <st=
rong data-start=3D"7033" data-end=3D"7047">conditions</strong> sur le flux<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7062" data-end=3D"7116">
<p data-start=3D"7064" data-end=3D"7116">Exemple : r=C3=A9p=C3=A9tition tan=
t qu=E2=80=99une condition est vraie</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7118" data-end=3D"7121">
<h3 data-start=3D"7123" data-end=3D"7152">6.3. Signal et =C3=A9v=C3=A9nemen=
ts</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7154" data-end=3D"7298">
<li data-start=3D"7154" data-end=3D"7248">
<p data-start=3D"7156" data-end=3D"7248">Actions peuvent <strong data-start=
=3D"7172" data-end=3D"7195">envoyer ou recevoir</strong> des signaux (ex : =
notification, =C3=A9v=C3=A9nement externe)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7249" data-end=3D"7298">
<p data-start=3D"7251" data-end=3D"7298">Utiles pour mod=C3=A9liser des pro=
cessus asynchrones</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7300" data-end=3D"7303">
<h2 data-start=3D"7305" data-end=3D"7327">7. Bonnes pratiques</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"7329" data-end=3D"7332">
<ul data-start=3D"7334" data-end=3D"7779">
<li data-start=3D"7334" data-end=3D"7430">
<p data-start=3D"7336" data-end=3D"7430"><strong data-start=3D"7336" data-e=
nd=3D"7357">Clart=C3=A9 avant tout</strong> : garder le diagramme simple, d=
=C3=A9couper en sous-activit=C3=A9s si n=C3=A9cessaire</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7431" data-end=3D"7468">
<p data-start=3D"7433" data-end=3D"7468"><strong data-start=3D"7433" data-e=
nd=3D"7466">Nommer clairement les actions</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7469" data-end=3D"7541">
<p data-start=3D"7471" data-end=3D"7541"><strong data-start=3D"7471" data-e=
nd=3D"7505">Limiter le nombre de swimlanes</strong> pour =C3=A9viter la sur=
charge visuelle</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7542" data-end=3D"7596">
<p data-start=3D"7544" data-end=3D"7596">Utiliser les d=C3=A9cisions unique=
ment quand n=C3=A9cessaire</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7597" data-end=3D"7655">
<p data-start=3D"7599" data-end=3D"7655">Toujours valider les sc=C3=A9nario=
s avec les acteurs m=C3=A9tier</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7656" data-end=3D"7779">
<p data-start=3D"7658" data-end=3D"7779">Utiliser des outils UML qui suppor=
tent le drag &amp; drop des swimlanes (ex : Enterprise Architect, Visual Pa=
radigm, StarUML)</p>
</li>
</ul>
