=A7u pour vous faire passer du niveau d=C3=A9butant =C3=A0 expert, avec des=
 explications d=C3=A9taill=C3=A9es, des exemples pratiques, et des bonnes p=
ratiques.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"343" data-end=3D"346">
<h1 data-start=3D"348" data-end=3D"391">=F0=9F=93=98 Tutoriel UML =E2=80=93=
 Diagramme d=E2=80=99Activit=C3=A9s</h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"392" data-end=3D"449">Gestion des =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements, c=
onditions, et parall=C3=A9lisme</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"451" data-end=3D"454">
<h2 data-start=3D"456" data-end=3D"474">1. Introduction</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"476" data-end=3D"479">
<p data-start=3D"481" data-end=3D"690">Le diagramme d=E2=80=99activit=C3=A9=
s est un outil puissant pour mod=C3=A9liser les processus m=C3=A9tiers, wor=
kflows, ou comportements syst=C3=A8mes, en int=C3=A9grant la logique des =
=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements, des conditions, et la gestion du parall=C3=A9lisme.</=
p>
<p data-start=3D"692" data-end=3D"826">Ces concepts sont essentiels pour re=
pr=C3=A9senter des processus r=C3=A9alistes, souvent asynchrones et concurr=
ents, dans des syst=C3=A8mes modernes.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"828" data-end=3D"831">
<h2 data-start=3D"833" data-end=3D"875">2. Gestion des =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements=
 et conditions</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"877" data-end=3D"880">
<h3 data-start=3D"882" data-end=3D"925">2.1. Comprendre les =C3=A9v=C3=A9ne=
ments dans UML</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"927" data-end=3D"930">
<p data-start=3D"932" data-end=3D"1072">Un <strong data-start=3D"935" data-=
end=3D"948">=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement</strong> est une occurrence externe ou inte=
rne qui peut d=C3=A9clencher une action, une transition ou une interruption=
 dans le processus.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1074" data-end=3D"1187">
<li data-start=3D"1074" data-end=3D"1187">
<p data-start=3D"1076" data-end=3D"1187"><strong data-start=3D"1076" data-e=
nd=3D"1088">Exemples</strong> : r=C3=A9ception d=E2=80=99un message, expira=
tion d=E2=80=99un d=C3=A9lai, action utilisateur, changement d=E2=80=99=C3=
=A9tat d=E2=80=99un objet.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1189" data-end=3D"1192">
<h3 data-start=3D"1194" data-end=3D"1260">2.2. Mod=C3=A9lisation des =C3=A9=
v=C3=A9nements dans un diagramme d=E2=80=99activit=C3=A9s</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"1262" data-end=3D"1265">
<p data-start=3D"1267" data-end=3D"1359">Les =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements peuvent =
=C3=AAtre int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9s dans les diagrammes d=E2=80=99activit=C3=A9s d=
e plusieurs mani=C3=A8res :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1361" data-end=3D"1637">
<li data-start=3D"1361" data-end=3D"1455">
<p data-start=3D"1363" data-end=3D"1455"><strong data-start=3D"1363" data-e=
nd=3D"1397">N=C5=93uds =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements (Event nodes)</strong> : symbol=
isent la r=C3=A9ception ou l=E2=80=99=C3=A9mission d=E2=80=99un =C3=A9v=C3=
=A9nement</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1456" data-end=3D"1536">
<p data-start=3D"1458" data-end=3D"1536"><strong data-start=3D"1458" data-e=
nd=3D"1476">Actions signal</strong> : actions sp=C3=A9cifiques qui envoient=
 ou re=C3=A7oivent un signal</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1537" data-end=3D"1637">
<p data-start=3D"1539" data-end=3D"1637"><strong data-start=3D"1539" data-e=
nd=3D"1564">Interruptions de flux</strong> : certaines activit=C3=A9s peuve=
nt =C3=AAtre interrompues par un =C3=A9v=C3=A9nement externe</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1639" data-end=3D"1642">
<h4 data-start=3D"1644" data-end=3D"1681">Notation UML pour les =C3=A9v=C3=
=A9nements</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"1683" data-end=3D"1959">
<li data-start=3D"1683" data-end=3D"1772">
<p data-start=3D"1685" data-end=3D"1772"><strong data-start=3D"1685" data-e=
nd=3D"1718">N=C5=93ud de r=C3=A9ception d=E2=80=99=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement</stro=
ng> : un pentagone avec un symbole d=E2=80=99onde =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99int=C3=
=A9rieur</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1773" data-end=3D"1858">
<p data-start=3D"1775" data-end=3D"1858"><strong data-start=3D"1775" data-e=
nd=3D"1792">Action signal</strong> : un rectangle arrondi avec un symbole d=
e signal (=C3=A9clair, onde)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1859" data-end=3D"1959">
<p data-start=3D"1861" data-end=3D"1959"><strong data-start=3D"1861" data-e=
nd=3D"1883">R=C3=A9gion interrompue</strong> : une zone d=C3=A9limit=C3=A9e=
 dans laquelle un =C3=A9v=C3=A9nement peut interrompre l=E2=80=99activit=C3=
=A9</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1961" data-end=3D"1964">
<h3 data-start=3D"1966" data-end=3D"2017">2.3. Conditions dans les diagramm=
es d=E2=80=99activit=C3=A9s</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"2019" data-end=3D"2022">
<p data-start=3D"2024" data-end=3D"2111">Les <strong data-start=3D"2028" da=
ta-end=3D"2042">conditions</strong> sont des expressions bool=C3=A9ennes qu=
i contr=C3=B4lent le flux du processus.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2113" data-end=3D"2289">
<li data-start=3D"2113" data-end=3D"2213">
<p data-start=3D"2115" data-end=3D"2213">Elles sont g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement =
attach=C3=A9es aux <strong data-start=3D"2153" data-end=3D"2175">branches s=
ortantes</strong> d=E2=80=99un <strong data-start=3D"2181" data-end=3D"2201=
">n=C5=93ud de d=C3=A9cision</strong> (losange)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2214" data-end=3D"2289">
<p data-start=3D"2216" data-end=3D"2289">Exemple : <code data-start=3D"2226=
" data-end=3D"2246">[stock disponible]</code>, <code data-start=3D"2248" da=
ta-end=3D"2273">[autorisation accord=C3=A9e]</code>, <code data-start=3D"22=
75" data-end=3D"2289">[nombre &gt; 0]</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2291" data-end=3D"2294">
<h3 data-start=3D"2296" data-end=3D"2354">2.4. D=C3=A9cisions bas=C3=A9es s=
ur des =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements et conditions</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"2356" data-end=3D"2359">
<ul data-start=3D"2361" data-end=3D"2577">
<li data-start=3D"2361" data-end=3D"2482">
<p data-start=3D"2363" data-end=3D"2482">Lorsqu=E2=80=99un =C3=A9v=C3=A9nem=
ent survient, la transition vers une activit=C3=A9 d=C3=A9pend souvent d=E2=
=80=99une condition associ=C3=A9e =C3=A0 cet =C3=A9v=C3=A9nement</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2483" data-end=3D"2577">
<p data-start=3D"2485" data-end=3D"2577">Exemple : si le signal =E2=80=9Cco=
mmande re=C3=A7ue=E2=80=9D est capt=C3=A9, alors v=C3=A9rifier le stock ; s=
inon, attendre</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2579" data-end=3D"2582">
<h3 data-start=3D"2584" data-end=3D"2631">2.5. Mod=C3=A9liser les d=C3=A9la=
is et temporisations</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"2633" data-end=3D"2636">
<ul data-start=3D"2638" data-end=3D"2814">
<li data-start=3D"2638" data-end=3D"2734">
<p data-start=3D"2640" data-end=3D"2734">UML permet d=E2=80=99int=C3=A9grer=
 des <strong data-start=3D"2666" data-end=3D"2690">=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements tem=
porels</strong>, ex. : =E2=80=9Cattendre 5 secondes=E2=80=9D ou =E2=80=9Cti=
meout=E2=80=9D</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2735" data-end=3D"2814">
<p data-start=3D"2737" data-end=3D"2814">Utilis=C3=A9 pour mod=C3=A9liser d=
es d=C3=A9lais, des expirations, ou des cycles p=C3=A9riodiques</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2816" data-end=3D"2819">
<h2 data-start=3D"2821" data-end=3D"2871">3. Parall=C3=A9lisme dans les dia=
grammes d=E2=80=99activit=C3=A9s</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"2873" data-end=3D"2876">
<h3 data-start=3D"2878" data-end=3D"2923">3.1. Pourquoi mod=C3=A9liser le p=
arall=C3=A9lisme ?</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"2925" data-end=3D"2928">
<p data-start=3D"2930" data-end=3D"3076">Dans la r=C3=A9alit=C3=A9, plusieu=
rs t=C3=A2ches ou processus peuvent s=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cuter en parall=C3=A8=
le ou de mani=C3=A8re concurrente. Le parall=C3=A9lisme est indispensable p=
our :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3078" data-end=3D"3235">
<li data-start=3D"3078" data-end=3D"3122">
<p data-start=3D"3080" data-end=3D"3122">Optimiser la dur=C3=A9e totale d=
=E2=80=99un processus</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3123" data-end=3D"3181">
<p data-start=3D"3125" data-end=3D"3181">Repr=C3=A9senter les activit=C3=A9=
s ind=C3=A9pendantes ou simultan=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3182" data-end=3D"3235">
<p data-start=3D"3184" data-end=3D"3235">Mod=C3=A9liser des syst=C3=A8mes d=
istribu=C3=A9s ou multi-thread=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3237" data-end=3D"3240">
<h3 data-start=3D"3242" data-end=3D"3285">3.2. Notations UML pour le parall=
=C3=A9lisme</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"3287" data-end=3D"3290">
<p data-start=3D"3292" data-end=3D"3358">Le parall=C3=A9lisme est mod=C3=A9=
lis=C3=A9 =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99aide des <strong data-start=3D"3334" data-end=3D=
"3356">n=C5=93uds fork et join</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3360" data-end=3D"3606">
<li data-start=3D"3360" data-end=3D"3441">
<p data-start=3D"3362" data-end=3D"3441"><strong data-start=3D"3362" data-e=
nd=3D"3383">Fork (fourchette)</strong> : un flux unique se divise en plusie=
urs flux parall=C3=A8les</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3442" data-end=3D"3523">
<p data-start=3D"3444" data-end=3D"3523"><strong data-start=3D"3444" data-e=
nd=3D"3463">Join (jonction)</strong> : plusieurs flux parall=C3=A8les se re=
joignent en un seul flux</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3524" data-end=3D"3606">
<p data-start=3D"3526" data-end=3D"3606">Ils sont repr=C3=A9sent=C3=A9s par=
 un <strong data-start=3D"3554" data-end=3D"3606">rectangle =C3=A9pais (bar=
re horizontale ou verticale)</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3608" data-end=3D"3611">
<h3 data-start=3D"3613" data-end=3D"3636">3.3. Fonctionnement</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"3638" data-end=3D"3641">
<ul data-start=3D"3643" data-end=3D"3962">
<li data-start=3D"3643" data-end=3D"3737">
<p data-start=3D"3645" data-end=3D"3737">Au niveau du <strong data-start=3D=
"3658" data-end=3D"3666">fork</strong>, toutes les branches parall=C3=A8les=
 d=C3=A9marrent simultan=C3=A9ment (ou presque)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3738" data-end=3D"3841">
<p data-start=3D"3740" data-end=3D"3841">Chaque branche s=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9c=
ute ind=C3=A9pendamment, et peut elle-m=C3=AAme contenir des actions, d=C3=
=A9cisions, boucles</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3842" data-end=3D"3962">
<p data-start=3D"3844" data-end=3D"3962">Au niveau du <strong data-start=3D=
"3857" data-end=3D"3865">join</strong>, le flux ne continue que lorsque tou=
tes les branches parall=C3=A8les sont termin=C3=A9es (synchronisation)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3964" data-end=3D"3967">
<h3 data-start=3D"3969" data-end=3D"4008">3.4. Exemple simple de parall=C3=
=A9lisme</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"4010" data-end=3D"4013">
<p data-start=3D"4015" data-end=3D"4096">Imaginez un processus o=C3=B9 apr=
=C3=A8s r=C3=A9ception d=E2=80=99une commande, on lance simultan=C3=A9ment =
:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4098" data-end=3D"4168">
<li data-start=3D"4098" data-end=3D"4130">
<p data-start=3D"4100" data-end=3D"4130">La pr=C3=A9paration de la facture<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4131" data-end=3D"4154">
<p data-start=3D"4133" data-end=3D"4154">Le contr=C3=B4le qualit=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4155" data-end=3D"4168">
<p data-start=3D"4157" data-end=3D"4168">L=E2=80=99emballage</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4170" data-end=3D"4228">Une fois ces trois t=C3=A2ches ter=
min=C3=A9es, le colis est exp=C3=A9di=C3=A9.</p>
