<hr data-start=3D"1700" data-end=3D"1703">
<h3 data-start=3D"1705" data-end=3D"1723">2.2 Transition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1725" data-end=3D"1867">Une <strong data-start=3D"1729" da=
ta-end=3D"1743">transition</strong> est le <strong data-start=3D"1751" data=
-end=3D"1783">passage d=E2=80=99un =C3=A9tat =C3=A0 un autre</strong> en r=
=C3=A9ponse =C3=A0 un <strong data-start=3D"1800" data-end=3D"1813">=C3=A9v=
=C3=A9nement</strong>. Elle peut =C3=AAtre conditionnelle et inclure une ac=
tion.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"1869" data-end=3D"1887">=F0=9F=A1=86 Notation :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"1889" data-end=3D"1981">
<li data-start=3D"1889" data-end=3D"1932">
<p data-start=3D"1891" data-end=3D"1932">Une <strong data-start=3D"1895" da=
