<hr data-start=3D"2241" data-end=3D"2244">
<h3 data-start=3D"2246" data-end=3D"2271">2.3 =C3=89v=C3=A9nement (Event)</=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"2273" data-end=3D"2383">Un <strong data-start=3D"2276" dat=
a-end=3D"2289">=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement</strong> est une <strong data-start=3D"2=
298" data-end=3D"2312">occurrence</strong> d=C3=A9tect=C3=A9e dans le syst=
=C3=A8me. Il d=C3=A9clenche potentiellement une transition.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2385" data-end=3D"2409"><strong data-start=3D"2385" data-e=
nd=3D"2407">Types d=E2=80=99=C3=A9v=C3=A9nements</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2410" data-end=3D"2548">
<li data-start=3D"2410" data-end=3D"2440">
<p data-start=3D"2412" data-end=3D"2440"><strong data-start=3D"2412" data-e=
nd=3D"2422">Signal</strong> (message externe)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2441" data-end=3D"2471">
<p data-start=3D"2443" data-end=3D"2471"><strong data-start=3D"2443" data-e=
nd=3D"2452">Appel</strong> (m=C3=A9thode invoqu=C3=A9e)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2472" data-end=3D"2510">
<p data-start=3D"2474" data-end=3D"2510"><strong data-start=3D"2474" data-e=
nd=3D"2501">Changement de condition</strong> (<code data-start=3D"2503" dat=
a-end=3D"2509">when</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2511" data-end=3D"2548">
<p data-start=3D"2513" data-end=3D"2548"><strong data-start=3D"2513" data-e=
nd=3D"2535">=C3=89v=C3=A9nement temporel</strong> (<code data-start=3D"2537=
" data-end=3D"2547">after 5s</code>)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2550" data-end=3D"2553">
<h3 data-start=3D"2555" data-end=3D"2587">2.4 =C3=89tats initiaux et finaux=
</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2589" data-end=3D"2764">
<li data-start=3D"2589" data-end=3D"2673">
<p data-start=3D"2591" data-end=3D"2638"><strong data-start=3D"2591" data-e=
nd=3D"2607">=C3=89tat initial</strong> : point de d=C3=A9part du diagramme<=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"2641" data-end=3D"2673">
<li data-start=3D"2641" data-end=3D"2673">
<p data-start=3D"2643" data-end=3D"2673">Notation : cercle plein noir =E2=
=9A=AB</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2674" data-end=3D"2764">
<p data-start=3D"2676" data-end=3D"2712"><strong data-start=3D"2676" data-e=
nd=3D"2690">=C3=89tat final</strong> : fin du cycle de vie</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2715" data-end=3D"2764">
<li data-start=3D"2715" data-end=3D"2764">
<p data-start=3D"2717" data-end=3D"2764">Notation : cercle noir avec un cer=
cle autour =E2=AD=95=E2=9A=AB</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2766" data-end=3D"2769">
<h2 data-start=3D"2771" data-end=3D"2812">3. =C3=89tats compos=C3=A9s, sous=
-=C3=A9tats, r=C3=A9gions</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2814" data-end=3D"2930">UML permet de <strong data-start=
=3D"2828" data-end=3D"2842">structurer</strong> les diagrammes d=E2=80=99=
=C3=A9tats pour mod=C3=A9liser des comportements plus complexes et hi=C3=A9=
rarchis=C3=A9s.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2932" data-end=3D"2935">
<h3 data-start=3D"2937" data-end=3D"2978">3.1 =C3=89tats compos=C3=A9s (Com=
posite States)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2980" data-end=3D"3119">Un <strong data-start=3D"2983" dat=
a-end=3D"2999">=C3=A9tat compos=C3=A9</strong> contient un <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"3012" data-end=3D"3029">sous-automate</strong> complet. C=E2=80=99est=
 une mani=C3=A8re d=E2=80=99imbriquer plusieurs =C3=A9tats internes dans un=
 seul =C3=A9tat global.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3121" data-end=3D"3149">Pourquoi les utiliser ?</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3150" data-end=3D"3255">
<li data-start=3D"3150" data-end=3D"3182">
<p data-start=3D"3152" data-end=3D"3182">R=C3=A9duire la complexit=C3=A9 vi=
suelle</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3183" data-end=3D"3221">
<p data-start=3D"3185" data-end=3D"3221">Factoriser les comportements commu=
ns</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3222" data-end=3D"3255">
<p data-start=3D"3224" data-end=3D"3255">Isoler des comportements locaux</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"3257" data-end=3D"3274">=F0=9F=A7=B1 Exemple :</h4>
<p data-start=3D"3276" data-end=3D"3312">L=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat "EnCours" pour=
rait contenir :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3313" data-end=3D"3357">
<li data-start=3D"3313" data-end=3D"3327">
<p data-start=3D"3315" data-end=3D"3327">"Chargement"</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3328" data-end=3D"3339">
<p data-start=3D"3330" data-end=3D"3339">"Analyse"</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3340" data-end=3D"3357">
<p data-start=3D"3342" data-end=3D"3357">"R=C3=A9sultat pr=C3=AAt"</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3359" data-end=3D"3450">On entre dans l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat =
"EnCours", puis on suit les transitions entre les sous-=C3=A9tats internes.=
</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3452" data-end=3D"3455">
<h3 data-start=3D"3457" data-end=3D"3487">3.2 Sous-=C3=A9tats (Substates)</=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"3489" data-end=3D"3632">Les <strong data-start=3D"3493" da=
ta-end=3D"3507">sous-=C3=A9tats</strong> sont des =C3=A9tats contenus dans =
un <strong data-start=3D"3540" data-end=3D"3556">=C3=A9tat compos=C3=A9</st=
rong>. Ils peuvent avoir leur propre <strong data-start=3D"3588" data-end=
=3D"3604">=C3=A9tat initial</strong>, transitions internes, etc.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3634" data-end=3D"3660">Types de sous-=C3=A9tats :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3661" data-end=3D"3771">
<li data-start=3D"3661" data-end=3D"3724">
<p data-start=3D"3663" data-end=3D"3724"><strong data-start=3D"3663" data-e=
nd=3D"3678">S=C3=A9quentiels</strong> : s=E2=80=99encha=C3=AEnent dans une =
seule r=C3=A9gion (d=C3=A9faut)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3725" data-end=3D"3771">
<p data-start=3D"3727" data-end=3D"3771"><strong data-start=3D"3727" data-e=
nd=3D"3755">Orthogonaux / parall=C3=A8les</strong> (voir plus bas)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3773" data-end=3D"3776">
<h3 data-start=3D"3778" data-end=3D"3827">3.3 R=C3=A9gions orthogonales (r=
=C3=A9gions parall=C3=A8les)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3829" data-end=3D"3937">Les <strong data-start=3D"3833" da=
ta-end=3D"3844">r=C3=A9gions</strong> permettent d=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cuter <s=
trong data-start=3D"3867" data-end=3D"3910">plusieurs machines d=E2=80=99=
=C3=A9tats en parall=C3=A8le</strong> dans un m=C3=AAme =C3=A9tat compos=C3=
=A9.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3939" data-end=3D"3961">Exemple d=E2=80=99usage :</h4>
<p data-start=3D"3962" data-end=3D"4028">L=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat "Session activ=
e" d=E2=80=99un utilisateur peut avoir deux r=C3=A9gions :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4029" data-end=3D"4137">
<li data-start=3D"4029" data-end=3D"4084">
<p data-start=3D"4031" data-end=3D"4084">Gestion de la session (authentific=
ation, inactivit=C3=A9=E2=80=A6)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4085" data-end=3D"4137">
<p data-start=3D"4087" data-end=3D"4137">Surveillance des notifications (no=
uveaux messages)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4139" data-end=3D"4227">Les r=C3=A9gions sont ind=C3=A9pen=
dantes et peuvent avoir leurs propres transitions et sous-=C3=A9tats.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4229" data-end=3D"4247">=F0=9F=A7=A9 Notation :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4248" data-end=3D"4334">
<li data-start=3D"4248" data-end=3D"4334">
<p data-start=3D"4250" data-end=3D"4334">L=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat compos=C3=A9 e=
st d=C3=A9coup=C3=A9 en <strong data-start=3D"4280" data-end=3D"4307">compa=
rtiments verticaux</strong> repr=C3=A9sentant chaque r=C3=A9gion</p>
</li>
</ul>
