<p data-start=3D"598" data-end=3D"655">Il montre <strong data-start=3D"608"=
 data-end=3D"633">qui envoie quoi =C3=A0 qui</strong>, dans <strong data-st=
art=3D"640" data-end=3D"654">quel ordre</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"656" data-end=3D"741">
<p data-start=3D"658" data-end=3D"741">Il <strong data-start=3D"661" data-e=
nd=3D"688">mod=C3=A9lise la chronologie</strong> des =C3=A9changes de messa=
ges pour <strong data-start=3D"719" data-end=3D"740">un sc=C3=A9nario donn=
=C3=A9</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"742" data-end=3D"849">
<p data-start=3D"744" data-end=3D"849">Il aide =C3=A0 comprendre, d=C3=A9bo=
guer ou concevoir des processus m=C3=A9tier, des appels d'API, des algorith=
mes, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"851" data-end=3D"889">Il est particuli=C3=A8rement utilis=
=C3=A9 dans :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"890" data-end=3D"984">
<li data-start=3D"890" data-end=3D"923">
<p data-start=3D"892" data-end=3D"923">L=E2=80=99analyse des cas d=E2=80=99=
utilisation</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"924" data-end=3D"955">
<p data-start=3D"926" data-end=3D"955">L=E2=80=99architecture des composant=
s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"956" data-end=3D"984">
<p data-start=3D"958" data-end=3D"984">La documentation technique</p>
</li>
</ul>
