<h2 data-start=3D"991" data-end=3D"1046">=F0=9F=A7=A9 2. =C3=89l=C3=A9ments=
 de base : Objets, Lifelines, Messages</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"1048" data-end=3D"1051">
<h3 data-start=3D"1053" data-end=3D"1083">=F0=9F=A7=8D 2.1 Objets et Lifeli=
nes</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1085" data-end=3D"1208">Un <strong data-start=3D"1088" dat=
a-end=3D"1097">objet</strong> (ou instance de classe) dans un diagramme de =
s=C3=A9quence est repr=C3=A9sent=C3=A9 <strong data-start=3D"1167" data-end=
=3D"1207">horizontalement en haut du diagramme</strong>.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1210" data-end=3D"1360">
<li data-start=3D"1210" data-end=3D"1260">
<p data-start=3D"1212" data-end=3D"1260">Il est not=C3=A9 sous la forme : <=
code data-start=3D"1240" data-end=3D"1260">nomObjet:NomClasse</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1261" data-end=3D"1360">
<p data-start=3D"1263" data-end=3D"1360">Une <strong data-start=3D"1267" da=
ta-end=3D"1279">lifeline</strong> est une ligne verticale sous chaque objet=
, repr=C3=A9sentant <strong data-start=3D"1336" data-end=3D"1359">le passag=
e du temps</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
