<li data-start=3D"928" data-end=3D"984">
<p data-start=3D"930" data-end=3D"984">Montrer <strong data-start=3D"938" d=
ata-end=3D"966">quels objets collaborent</strong> dans un sc=C3=A9nario.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"985" data-end=3D"1082">
<p data-start=3D"987" data-end=3D"1082">Repr=C3=A9senter <strong data-start=
=3D"999" data-end=3D"1024">les messages =C3=A9chang=C3=A9s</strong> entre o=
bjets, <strong data-start=3D"1039" data-end=3D"1081">num=C3=A9rot=C3=A9s se=
lon leur ordre d=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cution</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1083" data-end=3D"1202">
<p data-start=3D"1085" data-end=3D"1202">Fournir une <strong data-start=3D"=
