<hr data-start=3D"2157" data-end=3D"2160">
<h3 data-start=3D"2162" data-end=3D"2211">2.2 Pourquoi utiliser une "vue al=
ternative" ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2213" data-end=3D"2436">
<li data-start=3D"2213" data-end=3D"2299">
<p data-start=3D"2215" data-end=3D"2299">Pour mettre en =C3=A9vidence <stro=
ng data-start=3D"2239" data-end=3D"2271">l=E2=80=99architecture d=E2=80=99u=
n sc=C3=A9nario</strong> plut=C3=B4t que son d=C3=A9roulement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2300" data-end=3D"2351">
<p data-start=3D"2302" data-end=3D"2351">Pour comprendre <strong data-start=
=3D"2318" data-end=3D"2350">le r=C3=B4le des objets entre eux</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2352" data-end=3D"2436">
<p data-start=3D"2354" data-end=3D"2436">Pour utiliser dans un <strong data=
-start=3D"2376" data-end=3D"2407">atelier de conception objet</strong> ou u=
ne revue d=E2=80=99architecture.</p>
</li>
</ul>
