<hr data-start=3D"3699" data-end=3D"3702">
<h2 data-start=3D"3704" data-end=3D"3758">4. =F0=9F=A7=A0 Utilisation pour =
la conception orient=C3=A9e objet</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"3760" data-end=3D"3763">
<p data-start=3D"3765" data-end=3D"3837">Le diagramme de communication est =
<strong data-start=3D"3799" data-end=3D"3820">extr=C3=AAmement utile</stron=
g> pour mod=C3=A9liser :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3839" data-end=3D"4068">
<li data-start=3D"3839" data-end=3D"3906">
<p data-start=3D"3841" data-end=3D"3906">Les <strong data-start=3D"3845" da=
ta-end=3D"3876">collaborations entre objets</strong> dans un design orient=
=C3=A9 objet.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3907" data-end=3D"4000">
<p data-start=3D"3909" data-end=3D"4000">Les <strong data-start=3D"3913" da=
ta-end=3D"3942">responsabilit=C3=A9s r=C3=A9parties</strong> selon les prin=
cipes GRASP (Controller, Expert, Creator=E2=80=A6).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4001" data-end=3D"4068">
<p data-start=3D"4003" data-end=3D"4068">Les <strong data-start=3D"4007" da=
ta-end=3D"4038">flux de contr=C3=B4le distribu=C3=A9s</strong> entre servic=
es ou composants.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4070" data-end=3D"4073">
<h3 data-start=3D"4075" data-end=3D"4115">4.1 Identifier les objets du syst=
=C3=A8me</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4117" data-end=3D"4257">
<li data-start=3D"4117" data-end=3D"4175">
<p data-start=3D"4120" data-end=3D"4175">Extraire les objets =C3=A0 partir =
d=E2=80=99un diagramme de classes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4176" data-end=3D"4257">
<p data-start=3D"4179" data-end=3D"4257">Sp=C3=A9cifier leur <strong data-s=
tart=3D"4194" data-end=3D"4219">r=C3=B4le dans un sc=C3=A9nario</strong> do=
nn=C3=A9 (ex. =E2=80=9Cvalidation de commande=E2=80=9D).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4259" data-end=3D"4262">
<h3 data-start=3D"4264" data-end=3D"4300">4.2 R=C3=A9partir les responsabil=
it=C3=A9s</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4302" data-end=3D"4328">Attribuer =C3=A0 chaque objet :</p=
>
<ul data-start=3D"4330" data-end=3D"4477">
<li data-start=3D"4330" data-end=3D"4403">
<p data-start=3D"4332" data-end=3D"4403">Une responsabilit=C3=A9 m=C3=A9tie=
r (par ex. <code data-start=3D"4367" data-end=3D"4402">gestionCommande : Co=
mmandeService</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4404" data-end=3D"4477">
<p data-start=3D"4406" data-end=3D"4477">Une responsabilit=C3=A9 de coordin=
ation (<code data-start=3D"4442" data-end=3D"4476">controleur : Gestionnair=
eSession</code>)</p>
</li>
</ul>
