<hr data-start=3D"3660" data-end=3D"3663">
<h3 data-start=3D"3665" data-end=3D"3699">3.3 =C3=89valuation des contraint=
es</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3701" data-end=3D"3725">L=E2=80=99=C3=A9valuation peut =C3=
=AAtre :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3727" data-end=3D"3832">
<li data-start=3D"3727" data-end=3D"3767">
<p data-start=3D"3729" data-end=3D"3767"><strong data-start=3D"3729" data-e=
nd=3D"3741">Statique</strong> : valid=C3=A9e =C3=A0 la conception</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3768" data-end=3D"3832">
<p data-start=3D"3770" data-end=3D"3832"><strong data-start=3D"3770" data-e=
nd=3D"3783">Dynamique</strong> : analys=C3=A9e =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cut=
ion (profilage, simulation)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3834" data-end=3D"3837">
<h2 data-start=3D"3839" data-end=3D"3870">=F0=9F=9B=A0=EF=B8=8F 4. Analyse =
de temps r=C3=A9el</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"3872" data-end=3D"3875">
<h3 data-start=3D"3877" data-end=3D"3895">4.1 D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3897" data-end=3D"4037">Un <strong data-start=3D"3900" dat=
a-end=3D"3922">syst=C3=A8me temps r=C3=A9el</strong> est un syst=C3=A8me da=
ns lequel le <strong data-start=3D"3953" data-end=3D"4005">respect des d=C3=
=A9lais d=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cution est aussi crucial</strong> que l=E2=80=99e=
xactitude des r=C3=A9sultats.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4039" data-end=3D"4049">Exemples :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4050" data-end=3D"4150">
<li data-start=3D"4050" data-end=3D"4097">
<p data-start=3D"4052" data-end=3D"4097">Syst=C3=A8mes embarqu=C3=A9s (auto=
mobile, a=C3=A9ronautique)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4098" data-end=3D"4118">
<p data-start=3D"4100" data-end=3D"4118">Robots industriels</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4119" data-end=3D"4150">
<p data-start=3D"4121" data-end=3D"4150">Syst=C3=A8mes de contr=C3=B4le m=
=C3=A9dicaux</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4152" data-end=3D"4155">
<h3 data-start=3D"4157" data-end=3D"4194">4.2 Utilit=C3=A9 du diagramme de =
temps</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4196" data-end=3D"4380">
<li data-start=3D"4196" data-end=3D"4251">
<p data-start=3D"4198" data-end=3D"4251">D=C3=A9terminer <strong data-start=
=3D"4209" data-end=3D"4251">si les d=C3=A9lais critiques sont respect=C3=A9=
s</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4252" data-end=3D"4300">
<p data-start=3D"4254" data-end=3D"4300">Rep=C3=A9rer les <strong data-star=
t=3D"4266" data-end=3D"4300">zones de latence ou de blocage</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4301" data-end=3D"4380">
<p data-start=3D"4303" data-end=3D"4380">V=C3=A9rifier que les <strong data=
-start=3D"4320" data-end=3D"4346">p=C3=A9riodes de traitement</strong> sont=
 compatibles avec le mat=C3=A9riel</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4382" data-end=3D"4385">
<h3 data-start=3D"4387" data-end=3D"4407">4.3 M=C3=A9thodologie</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"4409" data-end=3D"4441">=C3=89tapes typiques d=E2=80=99an=
alyse :</h4>
<ol data-start=3D"4443" data-end=3D"4690">
<li data-start=3D"4443" data-end=3D"4506">
<p data-start=3D"4446" data-end=3D"4506"><strong data-start=3D"4446" data-e=
nd=3D"4481">Identifier les points critiques</strong> (deadline, latence max=
).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4507" data-end=3D"4563">
<p data-start=3D"4510" data-end=3D"4563"><strong data-start=3D"4510" data-e=
nd=3D"4544">Mod=C3=A9liser les =C3=A9tats du syst=C3=A8me</strong> avec leu=
rs dur=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4564" data-end=3D"4624">
<p data-start=3D"4567" data-end=3D"4624"><strong data-start=3D"4567" data-e=
nd=3D"4624">Int=C3=A9grer les contraintes de synchronisation et d=C3=A9lai.=
</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4625" data-end=3D"4690">
<p data-start=3D"4628" data-end=3D"4690"><strong data-start=3D"4628" data-e=
nd=3D"4690">Valider le mod=C3=A8le par simulation ou v=C3=A9rification form=
elle.</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
