<hr data-start=3D"4777" data-end=3D"4780">
<h2 data-start=3D"4782" data-end=3D"4832">=F0=9F=8E=AF 6. Bonnes pratiques =
pour sc=C3=A9narios complexes</h2>
<ol data-start=3D"4834" data-end=3D"5279">
<li data-start=3D"4834" data-end=3D"4926">
<p data-start=3D"4837" data-end=3D"4926"><strong data-start=3D"4837" data-e=
nd=3D"4889">Divisez le diagramme en fragments visuels clairs</strong> (bouc=
les, conditions, parall=C3=A9lisme).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4927" data-end=3D"4990">
<p data-start=3D"4930" data-end=3D"4990"><strong data-start=3D"4930" data-e=
nd=3D"4965">Gardez un axe temporel uniforme</strong> (ms, s, =C2=B5s) et co=
h=C3=A9rent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4991" data-end=3D"5092">
<p data-start=3D"4994" data-end=3D"5092">Utilisez <strong data-start=3D"500=
3" data-end=3D"5038">des couleurs ou des annotations</strong> pour distingu=
er les fragments (si l=E2=80=99outil le permet).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5093" data-end=3D"5152">
<p data-start=3D"5096" data-end=3D"5152">Pr=C3=A9voyez <strong data-start=
=3D"5105" data-end=3D"5151">une l=C3=A9gende si les fragments sont nombreux=
</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5153" data-end=3D"5279">
<p data-start=3D"5156" data-end=3D"5279">Compl=C3=A9tez le diagramme avec <=
strong data-start=3D"5184" data-end=3D"5220">des notes ou des contraintes U=
ML</strong> (<code data-start=3D"5222" data-end=3D"5232">duration</code>, <=
code data-start=3D"5234" data-end=3D"5250">timeConstraint</code>) pour form=
aliser la logique.</p>
</li>
</ol>
