<p data-start=3D"6311" data-end=3D"6375"><strong data-start=3D"6311" data-e=
nd=3D"6333">diagrammes d=E2=80=99=C3=A9tats</strong> pour repr=C3=A9senter =
la logique de transition</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6378" data-end=3D"6439">
<p data-start=3D"6380" data-end=3D"6439"><strong data-start=3D"6380" data-e=
