<li data-start=3D"5071" data-end=3D"5162">
<p data-start=3D"5074" data-end=3D"5162"><strong data-start=3D"5074" data-e=
nd=3D"5094">Aligner les noms</strong> des classes, op=C3=A9rations, acteurs=
