us les diagrammes)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5249" data-end=3D"5342">
<p data-start=3D"5252" data-end=3D"5342"><strong data-start=3D"5252" data-e=
nd=3D"5283">Synchroniser les diagrammes</strong> apr=C3=A8s des changements=
