<li data-start=3D"5648" data-end=3D"5722">
<p data-start=3D"5650" data-end=3D"5686"><strong data-start=3D"5650" data-e=
nd=3D"5684">Diagramme de cas d=E2=80=99utilisation</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5689" data-end=3D"5722">
<li data-start=3D"5689" data-end=3D"5722">
<p data-start=3D"5691" data-end=3D"5722"><code data-start=3D"5691" data-end=
=3D"5699">Client</code> peut <code data-start=3D"5705" data-end=3D"5722">pa=
sser commande</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
