<p data-start=3D"256" data-end=3D"428">Ces pratiques permettent de <strong =
data-start=3D"284" data-end=3D"319">professionnaliser l=E2=80=99usage d=E2=
=80=99UML</strong>, en assurant une <strong data-start=3D"337" data-end=3D"=
352">tra=C3=A7abilit=C3=A9</strong>, une <strong data-start=3D"358" data-en=
d=3D"383">qualit=C3=A9 de conception</strong>, et une <strong data-start=3D=
"392" data-end=3D"427">=C3=A9volution ma=C3=AEtris=C3=A9e des mod=C3=A8les<=
/strong>.</p>
