s mod=C3=A8les ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"610" data-end=3D"692">Un bon mod=C3=A8le UML <strong data-=
start=3D"628" data-end=3D"673">ne se limite pas =C3=A0 des diagrammes visue=
ls</strong>. Il doit pouvoir :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"694" data-end=3D"915">
<li data-start=3D"694" data-end=3D"743">
<p data-start=3D"696" data-end=3D"743">Expliquer clairement l=E2=80=99inten=
tion architecturale</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"744" data-end=3D"801">
<p data-start=3D"746" data-end=3D"801">Servir de <strong data-start=3D"756"=
 data-end=3D"779">r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rence technique</strong> pour les d=C3=A9ve=
loppeurs</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"802" data-end=3D"856">
<p data-start=3D"804" data-end=3D"856">Aider =C3=A0 la <strong data-start=
=3D"815" data-end=3D"856">communication entre parties prenantes</strong></p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"857" data-end=3D"915">
<p data-start=3D"859" data-end=3D"915">=C3=8Atre export=C3=A9 en documentat=
ion externe (PDF, HTML, DOCX=E2=80=A6)</p>
