<hr data-start=3D"3609" data-end=3D"3612">
<h3 data-start=3D"3614" data-end=3D"3652">=F0=9F=92=A1 Exemple de r=C3=A8gl=
es de validation</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3654" data-end=3D"4002">
<li data-start=3D"3654" data-end=3D"3731">
<p data-start=3D"3656" data-end=3D"3731">Une classe abstraite ne peut pas =
=C3=AAtre instanci=C3=A9e dans un diagramme d=E2=80=99objets</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3732" data-end=3D"3814">
<p data-start=3D"3734" data-end=3D"3814">Une relation d=E2=80=99association=
 doit avoir une cardinalit=C3=A9 valide (ex. <code data-start=3D"3800" data=
-end=3D"3806">0..*</code> vs <code data-start=3D"3810" data-end=3D"3813">1<=
/code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3815" data-end=3D"3883">
<p data-start=3D"3817" data-end=3D"3883">Un composant exposant une interfac=
e doit effectivement la r=C3=A9aliser</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3884" data-end=3D"3926">
<p data-start=3D"3886" data-end=3D"3926">Aucun attribut ne doit avoir de no=
m vide</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3927" data-end=3D"4002">
<p data-start=3D"3929" data-end=3D"4002">Un =C3=A9tat ne peut pas avoir une=
 transition vers lui-m=C3=AAme sans justification</p>
</li>
</ul>
