<hr data-start=3D"5761" data-end=3D"5764">
<h3 data-start=3D"5766" data-end=3D"5801">=F0=9F=A4=9D Refactoring multi-di=
agrammes</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5803" data-end=3D"5887">Un bon refactoring <strong data-st=
art=3D"5822" data-end=3D"5862">ne concerne pas qu=E2=80=99un seul diagramme=
</strong>. Il faut mettre =C3=A0 jour :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5889" data-end=3D"6025">
<li data-start=3D"5889" data-end=3D"5912">
<p data-start=3D"5891" data-end=3D"5912">Diagrammes de classes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5913" data-end=3D"5943">
<p data-start=3D"5915" data-end=3D"5943">S=C3=A9quences (objets, messages)<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5944" data-end=3D"5979">
<p data-start=3D"5946" data-end=3D"5979">Composants (interfaces modifi=C3=
=A9es)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5980" data-end=3D"6025">
<p data-start=3D"5982" data-end=3D"6025">Cas d=E2=80=99utilisation si compo=
rtements impact=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6027" data-end=3D"6151">Certains outils (comme Enterprise =
Architect) proposent une <strong data-start=3D"6086" data-end=3D"6129">prop=
agation automatique des changements</strong> dans les autres vues.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6153" data-end=3D"6156">
<h2 data-start=3D"6158" data-end=3D"6174">=F0=9F=94=9A Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6176" data-end=3D"6303">La <strong data-start=3D"6179" dat=
a-end=3D"6229">documentation, la validation et le refactoring</strong> sont=
 les <strong data-start=3D"6239" data-end=3D"6302">garants de la qualit=C3=
=A9 et de la long=C3=A9vit=C3=A9 de vos mod=C3=A8les UML</strong>.</p>
