<hr data-start=3D"2690" data-end=3D"2693">
<h2 data-start=3D"2695" data-end=3D"2773">=F0=9F=94=AC III. MDE =E2=80=93 M=
odel Driven Engineering (Ing=C3=A9nierie dirig=C3=A9e par les mod=C3=A8les)=
</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"2775" data-end=3D"2778">
<p data-start=3D"2780" data-end=3D"2922">La MDE est une approche plus <stro=
ng data-start=3D"2809" data-end=3D"2822">g=C3=A9n=C3=A9rique</strong> que M=
DA : elle ne se limite pas =C3=A0 UML, ni =C3=A0 des outils sp=C3=A9cifique=
s.<br data-start=3D"2890" data-end=3D"2893">
Elle repose sur le principe :</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"2924" data-end=3D"3010">
<p data-start=3D"2926" data-end=3D"3010"><strong data-start=3D"2926" data-e=
nd=3D"3010">"Les mod=C3=A8les sont des artefacts de premier ordre du proces=
sus de d=C3=A9veloppement."</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"3012" data-end=3D"3015">
<h3 data-start=3D"3017" data-end=3D"3037">=F0=9F=8E=AF Objectifs MDE</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3039" data-end=3D"3225">
<li data-start=3D"3039" data-end=3D"3093">
<p data-start=3D"3041" data-end=3D"3093"><strong data-start=3D"3041" data-e=
nd=3D"3056">Automatiser</strong> le d=C3=A9veloppement logiciel au maximum<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3094" data-end=3D"3150">
<p data-start=3D"3096" data-end=3D"3150">Am=C3=A9liorer la <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"3109" data-end=3D"3125">productivit=C3=A9</strong> et la <strong data=
-start=3D"3132" data-end=3D"3150">maintenabilit=C3=A9</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3151" data-end=3D"3225">
<p data-start=3D"3153" data-end=3D"3225">Garantir la <strong data-start=3D"=
3165" data-end=3D"3196">coh=C3=A9rence et la tra=C3=A7abilit=C3=A9</strong>=
 tout au long du cycle de vie</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3227" data-end=3D"3230">
<h3 data-start=3D"3232" data-end=3D"3263">=F0=9F=94=81 Processus typique en=
 MDE</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3265" data-end=3D"3461">
<li data-start=3D"3265" data-end=3D"3302">
<p data-start=3D"3268" data-end=3D"3302"><strong data-start=3D"3268" data-e=
nd=3D"3284">Mod=C3=A9lisation</strong> (UML, SysML, DSL)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3303" data-end=3D"3355">
<p data-start=3D"3306" data-end=3D"3355"><strong data-start=3D"3306" data-e=
nd=3D"3334">Transformation de mod=C3=A8le</strong> (mod=C3=A8le vers mod=C3=
=A8le)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3356" data-end=3D"3381">
<p data-start=3D"3359" data-end=3D"3381"><strong data-start=3D"3359" data-e=
nd=3D"3381">G=C3=A9n=C3=A9ration de code</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3382" data-end=3D"3429">
<p data-start=3D"3385" data-end=3D"3429"><strong data-start=3D"3385" data-e=
nd=3D"3429">G=C3=A9n=C3=A9ration de tests, documentation, etc.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3430" data-end=3D"3461">
<p data-start=3D"3433" data-end=3D"3461"><strong data-start=3D"3433" data-e=
nd=3D"3461">Validation et simulation</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3463" data-end=3D"3466">
