mod=C3=A8le UML conforme</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3571" data-end=3D"3793">
<li data-start=3D"3571" data-end=3D"3634">
<p data-start=3D"3573" data-end=3D"3634">Mod=C3=A8le PIM clair, coh=C3=A9re=
nt, <strong data-start=3D"3601" data-end=3D"3634">sans d=C3=A9pendances =C3=
=A0 une techno</strong></p>
